Jaasiel"},"message":"Setup inicial do frontend Angular do user-microservices\n\nCRUD de usuarios consumindo o api-gateway (login, criar conta, listar,\neditar, excluir), com autorizacao por role refletida na UI. Diferenca\nchave em relacao ao frontend do monolito: criar usuario vai por\n/auth/register (orquestra credencial + perfil nos dois servicos),\neditar vai direto no user-service via PUT /users/{id} sem campo de\nsenha, ja que esse servico nao guarda credencial.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68bb0808132db2eb7c738e303007aeeb28a3ffb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaasielsilva/user-microservices-frontend/git/trees/68bb0808132db2eb7c738e303007aeeb28a3ffb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaasielsilva/user-microservices-frontend/git/commits/5095281dc22c0332aa0ed738043a2878d77a215f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113997854?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaasielsilva","id":113997854,"login":"jaasielsilva","node_id":"U_kgDOBst4Hg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaasielsilva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jaasielsilva/user-micros