","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:36:26Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"v0.2.9: temperature is now the ring''s hero value; sensor order is temp, hum, CO2, press, VOC, bright","tree":{"sha":"0364580361fff2093e22e741a94b324b13d478a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/0364580361fff2093e22e741a94b324b13d478a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/c41b447e30c653dc21c50bcaa7f114c3db1c89ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/c41b447e30c653dc21c50bcaa7f114c3db1c89ad","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKGM0MWI0NDdlMzBjNjUzZGMyMWM1MGJjYWE3ZjExNGMzZGIxYzg5YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185","sha":"5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185"}],"sha":"c41b447e30c653dc21c50bcaa7f114c3db1c89ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/c41b447e30c653dc21c50bcaa7f114c3db1c89ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:19:56Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:19:56Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"v0.2.8: configurable temp/humidity comfort thresholds, fix rounded corners\n\n- Temperatur and Luftfeuchte now have configurable Wohlfuehlbereich (green)\n  and Warnbereich (yellow) ranges, like CO2/pressure/air quality/brightness\n  already had, instead of a fixed hardcoded band. Defaults match the\n  previous fixed values (20-23 C / 40-60%), so existing widgets look\n  unchanged until the values are edited.\n- Fix: the widget''s outer rounded corners could render square on the\n  bottom edge in some cases; switched the outer Card to overflow:hidden\n  with scrolling moved to an inner wrapped Box.","tree":{"sha":"3b951e1bea13d89fd07e5b17eb606451620de271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/3b951e1bea13d89fd07e5b17eb606451620de271"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDU0MDJmOTlhZWZmZjVhOTg3NzU4Y2JhYjcyZjc0NzBjMTRlNDExODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164","sha":"50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164"}],"sha":"5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/5402f99aefff5a987758cbab72f7470c14e41185"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:24:52Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:24:52Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"fix: Zimmername in Uebersichtszeile mit fester Breite, Werte jetzt spaltenbuendig (v0.2.7)\n\nDer Zimmername stand bisher mit flex: ''0 1 auto'' in der Zeile, wodurch\nder erste Sensorwert je nach Namenslaenge unterschiedlich weit links\nbegann (z.B. \"Leonard\" vs. \"Wohnzimmer\"). Feste Breite (96px, mit\nEllipsis bei zu langen Namen und title-Attribut fuer den vollen Namen)\nsorgt jetzt dafuer, dass die Werte aller Zimmer in einer Spalte\nbeginnen.","tree":{"sha":"c68a83ed4621a89a12492eb1ab89c41a47470872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/c68a83ed4621a89a12492eb1ab89c41a47470872"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDUwZDRjNDFmMGNlYjQwMWQ4YThmYWJmNWU5MmMzM2E5NGZiMzkxNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58","sha":"9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58"}],"sha":"50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/50d4c41f0ceb401d8a8fabf5e92c33a94fb39164"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:09:21Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:09:21Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"fix: digitale Mini-Werte in einer Zeile jetzt hoehenbuendig (v0.2.6)\n\nMiniReadout (shared/digitalUi.jsx) richtete Icon, Ziffernanzeige und\nEinheit per alignItems: ''baseline'' aus. Das Icon (SVG, keine echte\nText-Baseline) und die Einheit (ungesetzte Standard-Zeilenhoehe von\nMUI) konnten dadurch je nach Sensor leicht unterschiedlich hoch\nsitzen - am deutlichsten sichtbar, wenn mehrere MiniReadouts\nnebeneinander in einer Uebersichtszeile stehen. Fix: alignItems:\n''center'' plus explizit lineHeight: 1 auf der Einheit, damit alle\nWerte einer Zeile sauber auf einer Hoehe liegen.","tree":{"sha":"e52b08002c57bacb35e264c1702cd54be1b05f08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/e52b08002c57bacb35e264c1702cd54be1b05f08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDljMTUzZmM2ZmI4ZWE5ZTAyMjZmYjQwMTIxODVhNWJmZWE4ZTBkNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397","sha":"1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397"}],"sha":"9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c153fc6fb8ea9e0226fb4012185a5bfea8e0d58"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:11:29Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:11:29Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"feat: kompaktere Uebersichtszeilen ohne Ring, Grenzwerte fuer Luftdruck/VOC/Helligkeit (v0.2.5)\n\n- Zimmerzeilen der Raumsensor Uebersicht zeigen keinen Status-Ring mehr\n  (auf Nutzerwunsch entfernt fuer mehr Kompaktheit bei vielen Zimmern),\n  sondern nur noch Zimmername plus einzeilige digitale Mini-Werte pro\n  Sensor. Der Ring bleibt im Detail-Dialog (Antippen einer Zeile) erhalten.\n- MiniReadout (shared/digitalUi.jsx) um eine \"compact\"-Variante ohne\n  Beschriftungszeile erweitert, fuer die neue Uebersichtszeile genutzt.\n- Neue generische thresholdStatus()-Funktion: optionale Warn-/Kritisch-\n  Schwellen mit umkehrbarer Richtung (\"niedriger = schlechter\") fuer\n  Luftdruck, Luftqualitaet/VOC und Helligkeit - bisher immer neutral\n  eingefaerbt, jetzt wie CO2 konfigurierbar (Karte, Uebersicht manuell\n  und Uebersicht Auto-Erkennung). Ohne gesetzte Schwellen unveraendert\n  neutral (Akzentfarbe).","tree":{"sha":"6cd63eb1e484bb0e5102edbcbc333ee806bf1529","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/6cd63eb1e484bb0e5102edbcbc333ee806bf1529"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDEwMTFhNTkxNWIyNTk3MDg5YzMzNDI3OTZhYjhiYWExNjYxMDkzOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247","sha":"9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247"}],"sha":"1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/1011a5915b2597089c3342796ab8baa166109397"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:57:37Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:57:37Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"feat: Zimmerzeilen in der Uebersicht zeigen jetzt alle Sensorwerte (v0.2.4)\n\n- Uebersichtszeile nutzt jetzt dieselbe RoomBlock-Komponente wie\n  Einzelraum-Karte und Detail-Dialog: Ring zeigt den echten Hauptwert\n  (statt Platzhalter \"--\"), Temperatur/Luftfeuchte/etc. erscheinen\n  zusaetzlich als digitale Mini-Anzeigen direkt in der Zeile.\n- getState()-Fehlschlaege beim initialen Abruf automatisch erkannter\n  Datenpunkte werden jetzt geloggt statt still verschluckt, um\n  \"haengt auf neutral/keine Daten\"-Faelle diagnostizierbar zu machen.","tree":{"sha":"18c713acc22a465117c87fea1c918f25503e2963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/18c713acc22a465117c87fea1c918f25503e2963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDljMjI0YjQ1MTdlNGM2NmVlY2EyNWIzYWI3ZDAwOTAwZDA0NTcyNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557","sha":"ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557"}],"sha":"9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/9c224b4517e4c66eeca25b3ab7d00900d0457247"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:36:55Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T15:36:55Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"feat: Uebersicht erkennt Raumsensor-Karten jetzt projektweit, mit Live-Werten (v0.2.3)\n\n- Automatische Zimmererkennung durchsucht jetzt alle Seiten des Projekts\n  statt nur die aktuelle Seite, damit der typische Aufbau (jedes Zimmer\n  eine eigene Detailseite mit \"Raumsensor Karte\", zentrale Uebersichts-\n  seite sammelt alle Zimmer) unterstuetzt wird.\n- Werte der automatisch erkannten Karten werden jetzt live aktualisiert:\n  die Uebersicht abonniert die entsprechenden Datenpunkte explizit ueber\n  den Socket, da der vis-2-Editor sie sonst nicht automatisch mitliefert\n  (sie gehoeren ja formal zu anderen Widgets/Seiten). Abos werden beim\n  Unmount und bei Aenderung der erkannten Karten sauber aufgeraeumt.\n- README und i18n-Texte entsprechend angepasst (nicht mehr \"auf dieser\n  Seite\", sondern projektweit).\n- Version 0.2.2 -> 0.2.3 in io-package.json/package.json, News-Eintrag.","tree":{"sha":"08f895a22df45d49e4a8cdf8c88691f33e189579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/08f895a22df45d49e4a8cdf8c88691f33e189579"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKGNhMjg2MmUyODk5NTI2ZDU2ZmE0NjFkYzAxM2Y2ZDAwYmFiMTQ1NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2","sha":"93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2"}],"sha":"ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/ca2862e2899526d56fa461dc013f6d00bab14557"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:55:30Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:55:30Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"feat: Raumsensor Uebersicht kann Zimmer automatisch aus Karten der Seite uebernehmen (v0.2.2)\n\n- Neue Checkbox \"Zimmer automatisch aus Karten auf dieser Seite uebernehmen\"\n  in der Raumsensor-Uebersicht: liest alle \"Raumsensor Karte\"-Widgets der\n  gleichen vis-2-Seite aus dem Widget-Kontext (context.views) und uebernimmt\n  deren Titel/Datenpunkte automatisch, statt sie manuell doppelt zu pflegen.\n- Bei aktivierter Checkbox werden \"Anzahl Zimmer\" und die Zimmer-Gruppen im\n  Eigenschaften-Panel ausgeblendet.\n- Neue i18n-Keys (auto_detect_cards, no_cards_found_hint) in allen\n  Sprachdateien ergaenzt.\n- README aktualisiert (neue Checkbox in \"Widgets einsetzen\" und in der\n  Eigenschaften-Tabelle der Uebersicht dokumentiert).\n- Version 0.2.1 -> 0.2.2 in io-package.json/package.json, News-Eintrag ergaenzt.","tree":{"sha":"76f6363e2ca8688c5582346f6e636ca483c11319","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/76f6363e2ca8688c5582346f6e636ca483c11319"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDkzYTM3OGNhOGYyOWZiMDFiYjk2NDYzMDY4ODcyOWQ3ZDNiMTJlZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad","sha":"8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad"}],"sha":"93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/93a378ca8f29fb01bb964630688729d7d3b12ef2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:10:35Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T14:10:35Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"Fix: this-Bindung von t() crashte Editor beim Setzen eines Datenpunkts\n\nbuildSensors()/buildRoom() hielten eine freistehende Referenz auf die\nstatische Uebersetzungsfunktion (RaumsensorCard.t / RaumsensorSummary.t).\nSobald describeSensor() sie aufrief - was erst passiert, wenn mindestens\nein Datenpunkt gesetzt ist - ging der this-Bezug zur Klasse verloren und\nt() warf ''Cannot read properties of undefined (reading getI18nPrefix)''.\nDas riss ohne Error Boundary den kompletten vis-2-Editor mit ab.\n\n- t jetzt an die Klasse gebunden (Function.prototype.bind)\n- ErrorBoundary-Komponente ergaenzt: ein zukuenftiger Renderfehler faellt\n  nur noch auf das Widget selbst zurueck statt den ganzen Editor zu leeren\n- formatValue() gegen ungueltige Dezimalstellen abgesichert (toFixed\n  RangeError), StatusRing filtert fehlerhafte Eintraege defensiv heraus\n\nVersion 0.2.1.","tree":{"sha":"a5784f96459eeaf5215125604510ff9dfa9d8079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/a5784f96459eeaf5215125604510ff9dfa9d8079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDhlMmM0N2JhNDhkOWE1NDYxMjE4NTM0ODI5OTFjOTY5YTE1OWQ0YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8","sha":"62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8"}],"sha":"8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/8e2c47ba48d9a546121853482991c969a159d4ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:39:25Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:39:25Z","email":"paulpfeifer.mail@gmail.com","name":"Paul"},"message":"Raumsensor Widgets: initiale Version\n\nZwei vis-2 Widgets fuer Raumklimadaten (Temperatur, Luftfeuchte, CO2,\nLuftdruck, Luftqualitaet/VOC, Helligkeit): Raumsensor Karte (ein Zimmer)\nund Raumsensor Uebersicht (mehrere Zimmer + Detail-Dialog). Kompakter\nStatus-Ring mit eingebettetem 7-Segment-Font, konfigurierbare CO2-\nSchwellenwerte, gebaut auf Basis des offiziellen\nioBroker.vis-2-widgets-react-template.","tree":{"sha":"a2635fa03b4252defa6f0ae5599ae5a0ec365a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/trees/a2635fa03b4252defa6f0ae5599ae5a0ec365a86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/git/commits/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commit/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8","node_id":"C_kwDOUJyjCNoAKDYyNzQ3ZGEwZmRlZjc5YTUxOTczMWM5MTk3N2ExNDg1MzQ5MDJiZjg","parents":[],"sha":"62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits/62747da0fdef79a519731c91977a148534902bf8"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulpf/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-raumsensor/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c41b447e30c653dc21c50bcaa7f114c3db1c89ad&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A40%3A31.824Z"}');
