ordinates, booking locks, and cascade deletes\n\n- Purge all lat/lng coordinate fields and WGS-84 references across areas and product_locations schemas, DTOs, and queries.\n- Decouple transactional booking concurrency locks (SELECT FOR UPDATE) from catalog domain.\n- Replace all ON DELETE CASCADE foreign key constraints with ON DELETE RESTRICT / SET NULL across all relational schemas.\n- Maintain pure relational, flexible flat destination hierarchy with dynamic upward traversal.","tree":{"sha":"e925f10f4c309b2fd4d843e2d2e8f39c4067675d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/git/trees/e925f10f4c309b2fd4d843e2d2e8f39c4067675d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/git/commits/485d79fed9340eacae1cb5dc9c081dbd650178fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59465499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Haris-saifudin","id":59465499,"login":"Haris-saifudin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDY1NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/commit/485d79fed9340eacae1cb5dc9c081dbd650178fd","node_id":"C_kwDOUJ9JO9oAKDQ4NWQ3OWZlZDkzNDBlYWNhZTFjYjVkYzljMDgxZGJkNjUwMTc4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/commit/3850bb2946ff7b916382b2cded2b0a6738c614b0","sha":"3850bb2946ff7b916382b2cded2b0a6738c614b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/commits/3850bb2946ff7b916382b2cded2b0a6738c614b0"}],"sha":"485d79fed9340eacae1cb5dc9c081dbd650178fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/commits/485d79fed9340eacae1cb5dc9c081dbd650178fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59465499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Haris-saifudin","id":59465499,"login":"Haris-saifudin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDY1NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/commits/3850bb2946ff7b916382b2cded2b0a6738c614b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:31:09Z","email":"haris.saifudin99@gmail.com","name":"Haris Saifudin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T13:31:09Z","email":"haris.saifudin99@gmail.com","name":"Haris Saifudin"},"message":"refactor(catalog): streamline ATW integration, decouple PostGIS & booking locks, enforce flat hierarchy\n\n- Decouple PostGIS and spatial types: adopt standard WGS-84 float coordinates (lat, lng) and B-Tree indexing on (parent_id, area_type_id, slug).\n- Decouple transactional booking concurrency locks (SELECT FOR UPDATE, lock TTL) from catalog scope; expose nominal read-only availability (max_quota - booked_seats).\n- Enforce safe and idempotent catalog lifecycle via listing_status (''ACTIVE'', ''INACTIVE'', ''ARCHIVED'') and soft deletes (deleted_at) without hard cascade drops.\n- Implement flexible flat destination hierarchy allowing product locations to anchor at any tier (POI, Country, Sub-Continent, Continent) with dynamic upward traversal and nullable leaf tiers.\n- Synchronize all technical designs, API contracts, NestJS backend guides, Next.js frontend guides, and architecture documentation.","tree":{"sha":"8cf4bbe0ffc5c7287e1963afdf760127075ac283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/git/trees/8cf4bbe0ffc5c7287e1963afdf760127075ac283"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Haris-saifudin/hobiholidays-documentations/git/commits/3850bb2946ff7b916382b2cded2b0a6738c614b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59465499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Haris-saifudin","id":59465499,"login":"Haris-saifudin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDY1NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Haris-saifudin/orgs","received_events_url":"