committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T09:53:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nDecision D1: build_tracer refuses an unset OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT instead of\nexporting straight to Cloud Trace around the collector''s GenAI-content redaction, and\ntakes no project argument any more.\n\n- pyproject.toml and the locks: hex-service-kit v0.0.11 (ec2d724). The only other lock\n  movement is opentelemetry-exporter-gcp-trace and its dependencies leaving with the\n  kit''s otel extra, where this repo resolved it.\n- adapters/gcp/tracer.py: build_tracer(service=...) only.\n- tests/contract: the managed tracer''s documented refusal is now\n  CollectorEndpointRequiredError; on-prem keys off a new onprem_refuses field; a new\n  test keeps the old guarantee that with a collector configured and no SDK a span\n  degrades to a no-op.\n- settings, config, Terraform variable and adoption notes stop describing a direct\n  Cloud Trace path that no longer exists.\n\nRelocked without --upgrade: fleet-deps bump-commons'' --upgrade relock moved 19\nunrelated pins here, and those were reverted.","tree":{"sha":"b64093cb8e452f634669c5df2261a8d8bc22828d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/b64093cb8e452f634669c5df2261a8d8bc22828d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/1103475b8320f0a6d9ce3220a306a1e7896f7a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/1103475b8320f0a6d9ce3220a306a1e7896f7a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDExMDM0NzViODMyMGYwYTZkOWNlMzIyMGEzMDZhMWU3ODk2ZjdhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf","sha":"77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf"}],"sha":"1103475b8320f0a6d9ce3220a306a1e7896f7a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/1103475b8320f0a6d9ce3220a306a1e7896f7a8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:38:57Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T04:42:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Screen both model jobs through a fail-closed guardrail port (rule R1)\n\nPhase P3 of the guardrail/registry/observability plan, on the fixed design from\nhex-service-template: untrusted adverse-media text reaches the model here, and nothing\nscreened it.\n\n- ports/guardrail.py and adapters/{local,gcp,onprem}/guardrail.py: the template''s fixed\n  adapters. Model Armor allows only on filter_match_state NO_MATCH_FOUND with\n  invocation_result SUCCESS, read by the enum''s name (str() of the proto-plus IntEnum is its\n  number, so the earlier substring test allowed everything); a match, a PARTIAL or FAILURE\n  screen, an absent result and any API error or deadline (model_armor.timeout_seconds) refuse.\n  The client is injectable so screen() is tested rather than marked no-cover.\n- domain/watchlist_service.py: both model jobs (the adverse-media categorisation and the memo\n  draft) route through _screened_generate, which screens the prompt INPUT as sent (every field\n  it carries, joined) before the model is called and the answer OUTPUT before anything parses\n  or validates it. Each screen''s text is used exactly as given; the model now receives the\n  screened prompt and the caller the screened answer, never the unscreened original. A\n  refusal, and a guardrail that raises instead of deciding, are audited Decision.BLOCKED and\n  fall back to fixed text (narration is optional by design): the item stays UNCLEAR, the memo\n  is discarded with the reason. A refusal whose BLOCKED record cannot be written fails the\n  review instead of becoming a quiet fallback.\n- domain/kernel.py: GuardrailVerdict refuses allowed-without-text and blocked-with-text;\n  AuditEvent.severity is optional, so a categorisation refusal records no band nothing scored.\n- config: CREDITEWS_GUARDRAIL in three states, ModelArmorSettings with a real template_id, the\n  regional host and a validated deadline, and a managed-profile boot refusal with no template.\n- google-cloud-modelarmor in the [gcp] extra, 0.7.1 in requirements-gcp.lock (make lock; the\n  dev lock is unchanged).\n- infra/terraform: model_armor.tf gated on model_armor_full_capabilities with template_metadata\n  and ignore_partial_invocation_failures = false; roles/modelarmor.user, the API, the VPC-SC\n  entry, a guardrail-block metric, the CREDITEWS_GUARDRAIL env and reserved name; the\n  google-beta provider, its lock entry and a mock in both tftest files; tfvars.example states\n  false for asia-southeast1.\n- scripts/demo.py: a guardrail row in EXIT_CALLS, so the exit tour proves the placeholder\n  refuses.\n- tests: test_guardrail_screening.py (switch, boot refusal, heuristic tables, and the domain\n  proofs over the real ports: order of screens around every call, screened text used exactly,\n  input/output refusals per job, an injected headline end to end, fail-closed and unaudited\n  cases), test_model_armor_verdict_mirror.py (SDK-free, every gate) and\n  test_model_armor_mapping.py (the real modelarmor_v1 types; skips without the SDK unless\n  CREDITEWS_REQUIRE_MODEL_ARMOR_SDK=1).\n- Docs: COMPLIANCE R1 to Covered, ARCHITECTURE, runbook, onprem-migration, model card,\n  ADOPTING, the FAQs and practices-audit A8 no longer say the guardrail is unbound.","tree":{"sha":"500bcac54acd412de949a426b3c86fbf388ab8e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/500bcac54acd412de949a426b3c86fbf388ab8e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDc3YjExMzcyMjgzMWM5NzMyNTg4NDMyZjFkYjIyZWU2YWZhMzVjY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/5061cc7cd80a4437bf92c54b4907c332a9cbaec3","sha":"5061cc7cd80a4437bf92c54b4907c332a9cbaec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/5061cc7cd80a4437bf92c54b4907c332a9cbaec3"}],"sha":"77b113722831c9732588432f1db22ee6afa35ccf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/po