//api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/01739d21977aae8fa8f567d7941d1781ccec28b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:03:37Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:09:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Show the model that answered as two pills, not a banner, on hex-service-kit v0.0.10\n\nThe console''s full-width provenance banner becomes two small pills at the top right\n(ui/app/ModelPills.tsx): the model that answered the last request, read from the\nX-Answered-By header the service now emits (install_answer_provenance), and Search while\nX-Search-Used is true. Until an answer arrives the pill shows the configured generator_model\nfrom /healthz, dimmed. The proxy route forwards both headers; the banner and its CSS are gone.\n\nThe Gemini narrator notes the model it called; the local narrator notes its stub name; the\nlive lane''s kit client notes itself. No adapter attaches an online search tool.\n\nSampling is per call: GenerationPort.generate takes temperature: float | None = None and the\nGemini adapter omits it when None. The media categorisation stays pinned at 0.0 (a\nclassification the engine compares); the memo draft is drafting and sends none.\n\nThe use_hard_reasoning branch is deleted from the generator_model resolver.","tree":{"sha":"c910c8bd44ccbacc9dc542ee73b87e003fbccefa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/c910c8bd44ccbacc9dc542ee73b87e003fbccefa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/01739d21977aae8fa8f567d7941d1781ccec28b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/01739d21977aae8fa8f567d7941d1781ccec28b3","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDAxNzM5ZDIxOTc3YWFlOGZhOGY1NjdkNzk0MWQxNzgxY2NlYzI4YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/e9b642bd8c82263c704e970d996d8623cf874912","sha":"e9b642bd8c82263c704e970d996d8623cf874912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e9b642bd8c82263c704e970d996d8623cf874912"}],"sha":"01739d21977aae8fa8f567d7941d1781ccec28b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/01739d21977aae8fa8f567d7941d1781ccec28b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e9b642bd8c82263c704e970d996d8623cf874912/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:32:04Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T13:35:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Add the live profile: narration on a local open-weight model via the kit client\n\nThe laptop live lane binds the generation port to Gemma 4 31B (or whatever\nLOCAL_MODEL names) through hex-service-kit v0.0.9''s localmodel client, and\nevery other port to the same adapter local binds. live takes exactly the\nlocal posture (loopback bind, seeded personas, dev CORS, plain-text logs, no\nHSTS) through config.posture_profile, so the commons helpers that recognise\n\"local\" by exact match are never handed a string they do not know.\n\nThe adapter asks what the managed narrator asks: the same system instruction\nand token budget (moved into domain/narration.py so both import one copy) and\ntemperature 0.0. complete_json with no schema stands in for Gemini''s JSON\nmode; the domain still owns the shape check. An unusable answer after every\nretry is returned for the domain to discard, and an unreachable server raises\nLocalModelUnavailable unchanged, as the managed adapter lets its SDK error\nthrough. The provenance banner names the configured local model.\n\nmake demo, CI and the gate stay on the deterministic local profile.","tree":{"sha":"0de999c6f364c423a055214861b3e8e6debf76be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/0de999c6f364c423a055214861b3e8e6debf76be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/e9b642bd8c82263c704e970d996d8623cf874912","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/sta