26e3f1a8830a8006b99ab1a5707fa64dfe31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:50:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T03:56:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin review-kit v0.0.2, the release the rest of the fleet uses\n\nportfolio-status section 10 fails while the fleet pins review-kit at two\nversions. v0.0.2 only adds an optional bearer_provider parameter to\nReviewClient, so existing callers are unchanged; the lockfiles now pin\nits commit dec72b6.\n\nThe relock also moved these, because pyproject.toml on main already pins them exactly and a\npyproject-only Dependabot bump had left the lockfiles behind (a removal follows from a moved\nparent no longer requiring it):\n- ruff 0.16.5->0.16.7","tree":{"sha":"701c492fd75519e9b1a9d7296c0ba5d0bee416ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/701c492fd75519e9b1a9d7296c0ba5d0bee416ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/8b1226e3f1a8830a8006b99ab1a5707fa64dfe31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":fa