on that took the key. Block\nbindings became dynamic blocks; scalar bindings read the key through one(),\nwhich is null when the key does not exist and omits the attribute rather\nthan pointing it at nothing. The Terraform tests that assert on key material\nturn the gate on to keep meaning what they meant.\n\nWhy the default is off: a key ring can never be deleted, a log bucket that\nhas CMEK can never drop it, and registries and document stores take their\nkey at creation. None of that changes an answer or a screen, and everything\nis encrypted at rest with Google-managed keys regardless. A deployment with\na customer whose data it must shred, whose key access must be audited or\nwhose keys must live in an HSM sets it true in its own tfvars BEFORE the\nfirst apply. Where a stack already applied it, the key''s prevent_destroy\nrefuses a plan that omits the line, which is the right answer: the stores it\nbound stay bound.\n\nThe vendored deploy-and-residency-hardening skill says the same.","tree":{"sha":"85fd78f6bf591bc35d941b3aab9b1390ea5b93c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/85fd78f6bf591bc35d941b3aab9b1390ea5b93c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/b2b06951473a6614806440692cb449fb24e5786e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/b2b06951473a6614806440692cb449fb24e5786e","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGIyYjA2OTUxNDczYTY2MTQ4MDY0NDA2OTJjYjQ0OWZiMjRlNTc4NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6","sha":"8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6"}],"sha":"b2b06951473a6614806440692cb449fb24e5786e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/b2b06951473a6614806440692cb449fb24e5786e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:17:30Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:30:11Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Resync the embeddable-UI skill: both assertion header names\n\nThe canonical skill told the next repository to verify \"the injected\n`x-goog-iap-jwt-assertion`\" and nothing else, which is the instruction that\nproduced the defect this branch fixes. Fixed at the source in org-metadata and\nvendored here.\n\nOnly this one skill is resynced rather than the whole set, because\ndeploy-and-residency-hardening is in flight on another branch and a blanket\n`sync-skills.sh` would pull that unmerged work in with it.","tree":{"sha":"267042cc074be11357be630959fdbb835d3d6a27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/267042cc074be11357be630959fdbb835d3d6a27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDg1NDFhOWJkYWQ4YTEwMTZhMDMxMzgyOWQzMzRjZTFhNmViZDMwYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71","sha":"be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71"}],"sha":"8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8541a9bdad8a1016a0313829d334ce1a6ebd30a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:03:02Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T14:30:11Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Read the IAP assertion under both names a request can carry it\n\n`x-goog-*` is Google''s reserved namespace and the serverless frontend strips\nthat whole namespace from a request entering a service, so an embedding host\nbehind IAP cannot forward the assertion its own edge was handed under the\nstandard name. It sends the same value as `x-portal-iap-assertion` as well,\nand this adapter read only the reserved one.\n\nSo this service would have answered 401 to EVERY authenticated caller the day\nit was embedded, and said \"request did not pass through IAP\" about a request\nthat passed through IAP one hop earlier. Nothing would have reported it: the\ngate is green, a console''s first calls need no identity at all, and the unit\nsuite builds its own request, so it could only ever choose the header the\nauthor had in mind.\n\nThe read is now the commons selection function, which examines both names,\nprefers the edge-injected one for diagnosis rather than for trust, strips so a\nheader a proxy rendered blank is absent rather than malformed, and names both\nheaders in its refusal so an operator reads which hop dropped one.\n\ntests/unit/test_embedded_assertion_transport.py is the standing proof, and it\nwas falsified first: with only the header read reverted, five of its cases\nfail, including the one that resolves the contradiction between a passing\nclaim suite and a live 401.","tree":{"sha":"8998bea37b2069565a44d75d2f34233d7e9671d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/8998bea37b2069565a44d75d2f34233d7e9671d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGJlNDY3MzJiMmE3MWIwZDJkMTgxOGZmMDQ1MWI0OWYwNjE0MzdiNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9","sha":"efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9"}],"sha":"be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/be46732b2a71b0d2d1818ff0451b49f061437b71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:40:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:54:12Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the posture alerts, and stop copying every audit log into this bucket\n\nTwo changes the deployed stacks already carry, brought to the rest of the\nfleet so a fork does not inherit either on its first apply.\n\nThe posture alert policies and the log-based metrics behind them now sit\nbehind posture_alerts_enabled, default false. Cloud Monitoring bills every\nmetric-based alert condition, and a deployment with nobody on call buys\nnothing with them; the signals still land in Cloud Logging, where an operator\ncan read them.\n\nThe audit sink routes only this application''s own ledger into its bucket. It\nused to copy every Cloud Audit Log entry as well, which is a second\nCMEK-encrypted ingestion of what _Default already keeps for thirty days.\n\nNothing here is applied anywhere, so neither change moves a live resource.\nWhat they remove is the trap a fork inherits the day it applies.","tree":{"sha":"ff6ed164bbca6874b84338511b50714d907d1620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/ff6ed164bbca6874b84338511b50714d907d1620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGVmZThmZDJiNjNkNjU5OTI1MTlhYzMxNzAyNmYwNmE0ZWNjOWE0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1","sha":"e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1"}],"sha":"efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efe8fd2b63d65992519ac317026f06a4ecc9a4c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:04:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T10:12:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Vendor the reduced required-artifact set\n\nThe portfolio gate stopped requiring `docs/practices-audit.md`,\n`docs/onprem-migration.md` and a fleet-wide `COMPLIANCE.md` on 2026-09-13, and the\ncanonical skills README was updated to match. This is the vendored copy following, so\nthe convention this repository carries is the one actually in force.\n\nThe scorecard shipped PRE-FILLED from a template render, so requiring it fleet-wide\nmeant every repository asserting a per-check verdict nobody had reached. The exit guide\ndocumented a migration for a profile that is a deliberate fail-fast placeholder. The\nprinciple-to-control mapping is now a launch-set expectation, because it is what a\nbuyer is shown.\n\nRetiring a requirement does not delete a file this repository already has. Nothing is\nremoved here; only the statement of what is required changes.\n\nVendored by `sync-skills.sh` from the canonical copy in org-metadata, never edited in\nplace, so the drift check stays green.","tree":{"sha":"73f3b62eb49e1d7dea10dfb5f17e8c61354de71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/73f3b62eb49e1d7dea10dfb5f17e8c61354de71d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGUwZmRhYjc5MDI5MmQwYmEyMjYyMWJiNzE4MTllZWRmOTU1YzE1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034","sha":"de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034"}],"sha":"e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e0fdab790292d0ba22621bb71819eedf955c15f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:26:46Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T09:47:38Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Gate the project audit config, and default it off\n\n`google_project_iam_audit_config` is AUTHORITATIVE for the service it names, so a\nstack declaring `allServices` does not add to the project''s audit configuration,\nit REPLACES it. Forty-eight stacks in this fleet declared it unconditionally and\nfour gated it, which is the collision the posture record already documents as the\nreason those four decline: a stack asking for DATA_READ and DATA_WRITE removes an\nADMIN_READ a sibling enabled, and Terraform reports it as a create rather than a\nchange, because the stack holds no prior state for a resource that is already live.\n\nThis stack now carries `manage_audit_config`, defaulted false. A deployment that\nwants data-access logging names it in its own tfvars, in exactly one stack per\nproject. Data-access logs are also the highest-volume class Cloud Logging ingests,\nand nothing in the reference deployment reads them.\n\nVerified: terraform fmt is clean and terraform validate passes on every touched\ntree; the three Terraform test suites asserting plan-level refusals pass.","tree":{"sha":"7ee304d224dc37a98253f32893c8b890a232d1c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/7ee304d224dc37a98253f32893c8b890a232d1c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGRlOTk1NTgyM2U0OTY0NDQxNDg1ZTM4ZDQ1OTZmODk1OGZkZjEwMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832","sha":"cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832"}],"sha":"de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/de9955823e4964441485e38d4596f8958fdf1034"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:34:32Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:37:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Declare the key the dataset stamps on every table, so a plan stops replacing them\n\nThe dataset declares a default_encryption_configuration, so BigQuery stamps that key\nonto every table it creates in it. None of this stack''s 3 table resources\ndeclared an encryption_configuration, so Terraform reads the live server-set block as\na REMOVAL, and removing an encryption configuration is a REPLACING change: the table\nis destroyed and recreated, and a recreated table holds no rows. The dataset is\napplied and loaded in the deployment project, so it was armed.\n\nProved by execution in cio-advisory on 2026-09-12, not reasoned about here: a plan\nbefore that stack''s first full apply reported every table as must be replaced, with\nencryption_configuration { # forces replacement } as the cause, over 63 loaded rows.\nIndependent of the loader defect fixed today: that one rewrote the declared schema,\nthis one removes the key.\n\nGuarded offline, each watched failing first against a copy with one declaration\ndeleted, and green again on restore: the contract test asserts every table declares\nan encryption_configuration naming the dataset''s key AND that the count of\ndeclarations equals the count of table resources, so a table added later without one\nfails; bigquery_cmek.tftest.hcl asserts the same at plan level under a mocked\nprovider.","tree":{"sha":"06269070f60de6470accb7ca85708a135f1bb49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/06269070f60de6470accb7ca85708a135f1bb49d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGNjNTkzM2EzNGFiZDFkZTMzYjkwNmE1MDdkNzg0ZDM4NzYxOWY4MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5","sha":"83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5"}],"sha":"cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/cc5933a34abd1de33b906a507d784d387619f832"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:16:27Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T07:19:15Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Load into the schema the table already has, instead of replacing it\n\nA BigQuery load with WRITE_TRUNCATE and no schema autodetects one from the rows\nand replaces the table''s own. Nothing fails when that happens: this book loaded,\nthe demos read it, and every gate stayed green.\n\nWhat it costs arrives at the next plan. The same loader shape was fixed in\ncio-advisory after planning that stack before its first full apply reported all\nfive tables of its demo book as must-be-replaced: the live schema carried its\ncolumns in the order the JSON serialised them with every mode relaxed to\nNULLABLE, while infra/terraform declares them REQUIRED in its own order, and\nBigQuery cannot narrow a mode in place. Terraform''s only move is to destroy and\nrecreate, and a recreated table holds no rows. This repository''s dataset is\napplied and loaded by the same shared pattern, so it was armed the same way.\n\nPassing the table''s own schema makes a row that does not fit the declared\ncolumns fail its load, which is the failure that belongs to a data defect. The\nshipped rows were checked against bigquery.tf column by column before this\nlanded, nested RECORDs and REQUIRED modes included, so the stricter load has\nnothing to reject.\n\ntests/unit/test_demo_book_loader_keeps_the_declared_schema.py drives the loader\nagainst a fake BigQuery client, because the offline venv holds no cloud SDK, and\nasserts every load job carries the schema of the table it writes to. Deleting\nthe argument on a copy of the loader turns it red.","tree":{"sha":"5efb7bd4c40f683b7997f01e7dd8f8d4b53ab82f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/5efb7bd4c40f683b7997f01e7dd8f8d4b53ab82f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDgzZjE5MDM3MzZiYTk0NGQyNTgxZThiYmVmOThkZjAwMjJmMWQ2YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced","sha":"8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced"}],"sha":"83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/83f1903736ba944d2581e8bbef98df0022f1d6b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:07:36Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T13:17:17Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump shared kits: hex-service-kit v0.0.8","tree":{"sha":"e231a36ba80a80eb1bd9f82196c4fd9a87fb8c4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/e231a36ba80a80eb1bd9f82196c4fd9a87fb8c4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDg5NjhlMGNlZmUzZGVlMDUwYWI0OTUyN2MyMjEyMDJmN2VhOThjZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050","sha":"ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050"}],"sha":"8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8968e0cefe3dee050ab49527c221202f7ea98ced"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:05:28Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:34:44Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Land the model-risk half, and stop the regression gate standing in for it\n\nThe scoring engine in `domain/early_warning.py` is a model under SR 11-7 and\nPRA SS1/23, and its own model card recorded conceptual soundness, outcome\nmonitoring, the override log and independent validation as Absent. The eval was\na regression harness pinned at 1.00 over 11 hand-written cases. That is the\nright bar for what it measures and it is evidence of nothing about predictive\nvalidity, which is a distinction that survives only as long as somebody keeps\nmaking it.\n\nA backtest needs a historical outcome sample and there is none here. This lands\nthe half that can be landed honestly, and refuses to overstate it.\n\n**The conceptual-soundness argument.** `docs/conceptual-soundness.md` says why\neach family leads deterioration, why FINANCIAL is capped at 40 and EXTERNAL at\n20, why the band edges sit at 35, 70 and 90 relative to those caps, and why the\nfloors move one way. Its second paragraph says it is reasoning and not evidence.\nIt names five things that would falsify it, of which one is now measured and\nfour are not.\n\n**The override and challenge log.** `docs/override-log.md` defines the schema,\nthe pseudonymised obligor reference, the closed reason-code set and the trigger\nlevels. The trigger levels are deliberately not thresholds in a rubric: a build\nthat failed on an override rate would teach people not to log overrides.\n\n**A discrimination harness against a stated assumption.**\n`eval/run_model_risk.py` scores the REAL engine over 240 synthetic obligors\nwhose labels come from the generative model recorded in\n`scripts/render_calibration_sample.py`. AUC 0.975 against a floor of 0.80.\n\nThe floor was chosen by measuring what it catches, and the measurements are the\nhonest part. Inverting the family caps so adverse media and process findings\ndominate, the exact failure the caps exist to prevent, drops it to 0.743 and\nfails: that is the red case the harness runs before it scores. Flattening every\nweight to 1 scores 0.951 and REVERSING the weight order scores 0.923, and both\npass. So this validates the family structure and the caps, and does not validate\nthe weights. That is recorded in the rubric, in the model card, in `docs/evals.md`\nand out loud in the demo, because the number is high enough to be misread.\n\n**Monitoring that escalates on absence.** `outcome_coverage` and\n`override_coverage` score 0.000 and fail. There is no outcomes feed and no\noverride entries, and a model nobody is watching looks exactly like a model with\na silent monitor: both produce no alerts. The mechanism is built before the data\nso that the day someone connects a feed, the thing that reads it is already here\nand already failing loudly.\n\nThe build does not stay red forever, because a gate that is red on every pull\nrequest gets bypassed and a bypassed control also produces a green tick\nsomewhere. `make gate` runs `--gate`, which enforces the two measurable metrics,\nprints the outstanding ones under an OUTSTANDING banner, and fails if the\noutstanding set stops agreeing with `docs/model-card.md`. Connect a feed and the\ngate goes red until the card is updated. `make model-risk-full` gives the\nunvarnished non-zero verdict.\n\n**No PD claim, enforced.** `tests/unit/test_no_probability_claim.py` scans\nshipped text for the composite being presented as a probability or a rating. It\nis negation-aware, because the model card, the compliance FAQ, the adopting\nguide and the engine''s own IFRS 9 comment all use the phrase to refuse the\nclaim, and a check that flagged them would be deleted within a week. Both\ndirections are tested.\n\nThe rest is the wave recipe. `THRESHOLDS` deleted; two rubric families that\n`assert_covers` holds in both directions and that a test refuses to let share a\nmetric name; `prove_before_scoring` as the first statement of both scored runs\nwith a proof named after every metric; `assert_denominator_supports` against the\ndenominator that actually reached each bar, which caught `narration_groundedness`\nbeing scored over routed proposals only; `docs/evals.md` generated from the\nrubrics and from real runs of both harnesses; E4 and E5 rows; pin to\n`agent-eval-kit@v0.0.3` and relock.\n\nTwo bars moved for arithmetic rather than appetite: `pii_safety` from 0.99 and\n`narration_groundedness` from 0.98, both to 1.00. Binary over 11 cases, 10/11 is\n0.909, so both were already all-or-nothing and read as though they were not.\n\nThe demo closes on the evals, because six good answers is the easy half. It runs\nboth harnesses live, breaks every regression metric in front of the room, shows\nthe two monitoring metrics failing with no control behind them, and names what\nnone of it measures. `scripts/walkthrough.py` fails the build if a metric\nreaches that slide without being shown to fail, or if a monitoring metric\nquietly starts passing while the card still records the control as Absent.","tree":{"sha":"8909c582f9e0088f41f4ea44240fd55575935de2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/8909c582f9e0088f41f4ea44240fd55575935de2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGFiMzVmNzRkOGFhOGNkMTg0Mjg1ZTQyZjA4NWFkZGI5YzBhMGQwNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1","sha":"efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1"}],"sha":"ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/ab35f74d8aa8cd184285e42f085addb9c0a0d050"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:21:05Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T13:35:50Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Serve the obligor warehouse from one book, and fix what the two stores disagreed about\n\nThe metric windows and arrears snapshots were declared in Python and read by an\nin-process adapter, so the BigQuery half the deployment runs on had never held a row\nand nothing offline could disagree with it. They are files now\n(src/credit_portfolio_ews/data/demo_book/, one per managed table, in the warehouse''s\nown column order), read by the DuckDB store the offline profiles serve, by the loader\nthat fills the dataset, by the fixture estate the demo and the eval read, and by the\ntests.\n\nTwo defects fell out of making the local profile run SQL, neither visible to a green\noffline gate:\n\nThe two stores disagreed about units by a factor of a hundred. bigquery.tf declared\ndrawn_amount and past_due_amount INTEGER and its comment called them minor units, while\nthe managed adapter has always multiplied what it reads by a hundred to reach minor\nunits, and its own test double answers a decimal major amount. Both could not be true,\nand an INTEGER cannot hold cents in any case. The difference lands on the absolute leg\nof the arrears materiality gate, which decides whether the past-due clock starts at\nall: on a deployment it would have run on figures a hundred times too large and\nclassified obligors the laptop calls immaterial. The columns are NUMERIC, the\nconversion is one function both adapters import, and a test runs one warehouse row\nthrough both.\n\nThe other tenant owned no rows. ports/tenancy.py requires 403 rather than an empty\nwindow for an obligor held elsewhere, and the managed adapter implements it by asking\nthe warehouse who owns the id; the book shipped one tenant, so that probe could never\nfind a row. The refusal was proved offline against a Python dictionary membership test\non a path that no longer exists. obl-omega-999 now carries a window and a snapshot, the\nlocal adapter decides the refusal by asking the store, and the loader keeps that\nobligor out of the deployment''s tenant.\n\nAlso: the manifest table the loader writes is declared, because the loader creates\nnothing and a missing manifest is a load that exits before its first row; the guard\niterates load_order() rather than TABLES for the same reason.\n\nGate green: 662 tests, eval 1.000 on every metric, 14 Terraform tests, docs, demo\nself-test. Both new schema guards were watched failing against the real defects first.","tree":{"sha":"a70803909e66283f630ade236cf9c1a82352bcf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/a70803909e66283f630ade236cf9c1a82352bcf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGVmYzZmZmM3NDc5Zjk5MDk1YTM3ZTZiZWYxM2UyMGQwOGQ5ZGY5ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/7eeee466d61b7d95b0e31efb745bd066abb39544","sha":"7eeee466d61b7d95b0e31efb745bd066abb39544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/7eeee466d61b7d95b0e31efb745bd066abb39544"}],"sha":"efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/efc6ffc7479f99095a37e6bef13e20d08d9df9d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/7eeee466d61b7d95b0e31efb745bd066abb39544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:15Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:36:09Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"dd77d4f012bc80e95577792b5f5adfc59a45f82e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/dd77d4f012bc80e95577792b5f5adfc59a45f82e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/7eeee466d61b7d95b0e31efb745bd066abb39544","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-ge