:"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:22:24Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Bump next from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4 in /ui in the npm-minor-patch group\n\nBumps the npm-minor-patch group in /ui with 1 update: [next](https://github.com/vercel/next.js).\n\n\nUpdates `next` from 16.3.3 to 16.3.4\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/compare/v16.3.3...v16.3.4)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: next\n  dependency-version: 16.3.4\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: npm-minor-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"627973370e8cc321512abd5d27d0e79e4c7ff95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/627973370e8cc321512abd5d27d0e79e4c7ff95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/f03a656c7eff3db59e2abb22b859fd492d0ea0be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/f03a656c7eff3db59e2abb22b859fd492d0ea0be","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGYwM2E2NTZjN2VmZjNkYjU5ZTJhYmIyMmI4NTlmZDQ5MmQwZWEwYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/6676b81e6369cfb46a6f7097e18f1904afa06837","sha":"6676b81e6369cfb46a6f7097e18f1904afa06837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/6676b81e6369cfb46a6f7097e18f1904afa06837"}],"sha":"f03a656c7eff3db59e2abb22b859fd492d0ea0be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/f03a656c7eff3db59e2abb22b859fd492d0ea0be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/6676b81e6369cfb46a6f7097e18f1904afa06837/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:51:58Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:59:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Pin the browser half of the provenance contract\n\nThis console''s provenance strip works. It names where the runtime sits and\nwhich model answers at the top of every page, reading both off `/healthz`\nthrough the same base the rest of the console reads. Nothing here changes that.\nWhat was missing is the check that says so.\n\nThe service half is already pinned, in tests/unit/test_api.py: the\nprofile implies a runtime, the schema carries both fields, the endpoint answers\nfrom the binding the container builds rather than from a literal. All of that\nwas also true and green on 2026-09-04 in eight consoles that had been rendering\nNOTHING on every page load since the banner landed. The strip there named\n`/api/agent`, the same-origin route handler the service template ships, in\ntrees that ship no such handler; the health call reached a path nothing serves\nand took the failure branch, which renders nothing on purpose, because a strip\nthat guessed would assert provenance it does not have. A check that cannot fail\nloudly fails as an ABSENCE, and an absent strip is what no reviewer notices. A\ngreen service half says nothing about whether a reader ever sees the sentence.\n\nSo the browser half gets its own file, asserting the three things the service\nhalf cannot: the strip is mounted in the LAYOUT rather than in a page, it names\nthe proxy exactly when this tree ships one, and whatever it pulls itself up by,\nthe host must carry that much padding to give back.\n\nThe assertions pin AGREEMENT rather than literals, because this fleet runs the\nconsole in more than one shape and a check keyed on one shape passes by\nblindness in the others. This tree keeps the strip in ui/app/ProvenanceBanner.tsx, styled with `.provenance-banner`;\nthe trees that took the 2026-08-31 sweep keep it in `ui/app/` under\n`.provenance-banner`. A survey keyed on the sweep''s path and class reported\nnine working consoles as having no banner at all, which is the mistake this\nfile is written not to make: it locates the component by the sentence it\nrenders, not by where the sentence sits.\n\nFalsified before it was trusted. Pointing the strip at `/api/agent` fails the\nfetch assertion; adding a negative top-margin utility, or removing the body\npadding a `.provenance-banner` margin cancels, fails the geometry one;\nunmounting it from the layout fails the third. Reverting each clears it.","tree":{"sha":"353f3be617bcfd41be94ee3225c6947193e7ad6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/353f3be617bcfd41be94ee3225c6947193e7ad6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/6676b81e6369cfb46a6f7097e18f1904afa06837","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawast