nce GitHub\nActions became the fleet''s live CI on 2026-09-02. The adoption FAQ''s fork\nguidance is otherwise unchanged: a repository still needs a\nrepository-policy.json entry to get a rendered caller and a required check.\nThe security FAQ''s \"no actions to pin\" claim still holds, for the accurate\nreason: this repository''s caller is rendered, not hand-written, so the two\nactions the fleet actually pins live in .github instead.","tree":{"sha":"045fd1429541c223286b6feec617efb437ca4c9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/045fd1429541c223286b6feec617efb437ca4c9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/25fb6fe6b82c31fd9845f9c62b3fbd6e8b76615b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/25fb6fe6b82c31fd9845f9c62b3fbd6e8b76615b","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDI1ZmI2ZmU2YjgyYzMxZmQ5ODQ1ZjljNjJiM2ZiZDZlOGI3NjYxNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac","sha":"788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac"}],"sha":"25fb6fe6b82c31fd9845f9c62b3fbd6e8b76615b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/25fb6fe6b82c31fd9845f9c62b3fbd6e8b76615b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:02:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T00:06:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Move the managed Gemini call from 2.5 Flash to 3.5 Flash\n\nBoth models are served in asia-southeast1 with a documented Singapore\nML-processing commitment, so this stays in-region; 3.5 Flash is simply the\ncurrent generation. Verified against the publisher on 2026-09-03: 3.6, 3.7 and\n3.8 Flash all commit ML processing to the `us` and `eu` multi-regions only, so\n3.5 is the newest Flash this residency boundary permits.\n\n`gemini-3.5-flash` honours temperature (0.0-2.0) and candidateCount, so the\ndeterministic call sites keep their behaviour, and no thinking parameters are\nset in this repo -- the 2.5 `thinking_budget` / 3.x `thinking_level` split does\nnot arise.\n\nModel card and compliance docs updated to match.","tree":{"sha":"2fe9b0e19b4d8d0e22330c73e8e742d0300443ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/2fe9b0e19b4d8d0e22330c73e8e742d0300443ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDc4OGMzYjBjYzY2NzE1ZGZkNmNlMTYyNjI2YmY1MjI0MzkxZTUwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408","sha":"e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408"}],"sha":"788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/788c3b0cc66715dfd6ce162626bf5224391e50ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:20:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:43:45Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Adopt the fleet''s GitHub Actions gate, alongside the Cloud Build one\n\nPart of the fleet''s move off paid Cloud Build, which bills SGD ~3.94/day for work that calls no\nGoogle Cloud API, reads no secret and holds no deploy authority. Actions runs the same work free\non a public repository. Proved on account-takeover-investigator first: both jobs green, 138s of\nwall clock against Cloud Build''s 266s, running the same run-grc-ci in the same reviewed image.\n\nNothing about branch protection changes here. `pr-<repo> (portable-genai-ci-sg)` remains the\nonly REQUIRED check, so this reports alongside it and cannot block a merge while it is proved.\n\nGENERATED, not written: org-metadata/scripts/render-actions-callers.py emits this from the same\nci/gcp/repository-policy.json entry the Cloud Build trigger is built from, and its --check mode\nfails on drift. The 196 workflow files retired on 2026-09-01 rotted because each was maintained\nby hand; this one has no hand to rot by.","tree":{"sha":"19552f6b0cbbdf5dc7a6c2621d0de0a10673d0dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/19552f6b0cbbdf5dc7a6c2621d0de0a10673d0dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGUxMzNjY2IwNmY1OTVkZTUwNzkwZjI0NmZjNGU4MmZjZTUwMzU0MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f","sha":"9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f"}],"sha":"e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/e133ccb06f595de50790f246fc4e82fce5035408"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:07:12Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T10:16:33Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Name what actually runs the demo surface, not a deleted workflow\n\nThe demo surface claimed a `demo-gate` workflow ran it on every push. That\nworkflow was deleted with the rest when GitHub Actions were retired as\nunrunnable, so the claim named a runner that could not run and nothing said so.\n\n`scripts/README.md` went further and said `make demo-selftest` and\n`make portability` \"run in CI on every push\". They ran nowhere. The headless arc\nsurvived only because `tests/unit/test_demo_surface.py` drives the same code\ninside `make gate`; the portability tour had no automated runner at all, and\nonly its existence was asserted.\n\nBoth now run in the hosted Cloud Build check: they are named in this\nrepository''s job contract in `org-metadata/ci/gcp/repository-policy.json`, so\nthe sentence is true again rather than deleted. They cost well under a second\neach.\n\nAlso corrected in the same pass: \"No stub service\" overstated the offline\nclaim. The engine has no stub, but the generation port is bound to an offline\nmodel stub that carries the word in its own model id. The demo shows that on\nscreen, so the prose should not contradict it.","tree":{"sha":"74851416d7bc471c85cba359d2a644959e161a98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/74851416d7bc471c85cba359d2a644959e161a98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDk2MzRmN2QxNWQ2OTkwOWMwMTJhOTAzNjkyMjI3ZGI5ZTRjMjA5NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae","sha":"c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae"}],"sha":"9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/9634f7d15d69909c012a903692227db9e4c2096f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:11:20Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T13:15:26Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Add this vertical''s own cloud resources, with residency and CMEK proved\n\nThe stack carried the hardened vertical-neutral posture (Org Policy, a regional CMEK ring, a\nlocked WORM log bucket, a dry-run-first perimeter) and none of this vertical''s OWN data\nresources. The catalog row said so; this closes it.\n\nAdded in one commit, as apis.tf''s own comment requires: the resource, its API, its CMEK\nservice-agent binding, its least-privilege role and its perimeter entry. CMEK does not cascade,\nand a resource created without the service-agent binding comes up successfully, encrypted under\nGoogle-managed keys, and looks identical in the console. The failure mode is a silent downgrade,\nnot an error, which is why all five halves land together.\n\nTwo assertions are new in the plan-only suite, and both were proved red before being kept:\nresidency, and that the CMEK block is present at all. The residency one exists because writing\nthis found a real defect. `var.region` DEFAULTS TO NULL in this stack; the effective region is\n`local.region`. On a required argument that fails the plan loudly. On an OPTIONAL one it does\nnot: it silently creates the resource in a US multi-region and the gate stays green. The first\ndraft of this commit had exactly that bug.\n\nThe CMEK assertion checks PRESENCE rather than the key id, because under mock_provider the\ncrypto key''s id is unknown at plan time and comparing against it is an unresolvable condition\nrather than a check. Presence is the property that matters anyway.\n\nNothing is applied. This is plan-only: terraform validate and the mock-provider suite.","tree":{"sha":"f8aeb2c506efd89821d1daf4d52987d28e6098f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/f8aeb2c506efd89821d1daf4d52987d28e6098f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGM0ODAxZjFiMmRkMTAyNmVmNjdiZTlhYjc4Yzc5Y2JhNDUyNWU0YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040","sha":"d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040"}],"sha":"c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/c4801f1b2dd1026ef67be9ab78c79cba4525e4ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:21:31Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:27:19Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Close the G3 and G5 documentation gaps, and add a model card\n\n`docs/ADOPTING.md` (G3), `docs/faq/` (G5) and `scripts/rename_fork.py` were the only fleet\nconventions this repository was missing: 53 of 57 siblings carried ADOPTING and 54 of 57 carried\nthe FAQ set.\n\n`scripts/rename_fork.py` is proved rather than asserted. The self-test copies the tree, renames\nit end to end with `--include-docs`, builds a fresh venv from the renamed `pyproject.toml` and\nruns the renamed repository''s own gate. It found two real defects on the way: the renamer left\nthe backticked bare env prefix in `AGENTS.md` and `docs/practices-audit.md` (now rewritten, which\nthe sibling implementation still does not do), and adding a script broke the gate until\n`scripts/README.md` documented it.\n\n`infra/terraform/variables.tf` also carried the template''s shared `name_prefix` default of\n\"agent\". Every other repository in the fleet uses its own catalog id, and the variable''s own\ndescription warns that a shared prefix collides when two services deploy into one project. It now\nuses this repository''s id.\n\n`docs/model-card.md` is new. It records the model boundary and the controls that are still open;\nit does not close them, and the catalog row says so.","tree":{"sha":"891298c040e9ef20371a6fc150cc6888cbec6f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/891298c040e9ef20371a6fc150cc6888cbec6f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKGQyZWE2ZmE4ODg1MjI1NjI3Yzg1YmIwZThjNWRjNTkwMzk2YjEwNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/cf4e69f4890e266eebe8797a67cb60495f59ae47","sha":"cf4e69f4890e266eebe8797a67cb60495f59ae47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/cf4e69f4890e266eebe8797a67cb60495f59ae47"}],"sha":"d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/d2ea6fa8885225627c85bb0e8c5dc590396b1040"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/cf4e69f4890e266eebe8797a67cb60495f59ae47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:15:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:32:04Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Retire the GitHub Actions workflows, which had never run\n\nGitHub Actions are disabled for the whole organization\n(`enabled_repositories: \"none\"`), so every workflow file in this repository had\nnever executed and could not. The required check is the hosted Cloud Build\ntrigger, which already runs this repository''s gate, its ui-check where it has a\nUI, its terraform test, lint-gcp, and the IAP negative matrix against the\nruntime lockfile.\n\nUnrunnable configuration rots unobserved, and this had. The workflows still\npinned python 3.12 and 3.13 long after the fleet moved to 3.14, and the shared\nhard gate derived its environment prefix with a pattern that could not match any\nrepository whose prefix contains an underscore.\n\nRemoved:\n- .github/workflows/\n- the tests that asserted the contents of those files, and the test modules that\n  existed only to guard them\n- the github-actions dependabot ecosystem, which now has nothing left to pin\n\nKept, and repointed rather than deleted: every assertion that guarded something\nstill enforced. Where a test checked several things and only some were about a\nworkflow, the workflow lines were removed and the rest left standing.\n\nControl claims that cited a workflow as their evidence now name what actually\nenforces them. Where nothing does, they say so: the scheduled corpus refresh,\nthe managed release path and the promotion gate have no automated runner, which\nwas already true and is now written down.","tree":{"sha":"5ca8a70f3c7c7512e0ea79d70ace691e446e98e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/5ca8a70f3c7c7512e0ea79d70ace691e446e98e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/cf4e69f4890e266eebe8797a67cb60495f59ae47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https: