YWRiMDU2MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329","sha":"0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329"}],"sha":"9eb60c7f2173660fb7ce6720c2612fd5adb0561c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/9eb60c7f2173660fb7ce6720c2612fd5adb0561c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:15:59Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:24:03Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Stop next dev writing a second working agreement into ui/\n\n`next dev` generates `ui/AGENTS.md` and `ui/CLAUDE.md` and leaves them behind.\nThe catalog''s convention is that AGENTS.md is the working agreement and it is\nthe ONLY one, with no tool-specific alias, and this repo already carries its own\nat the root: the generated pair is a second agreement plus exactly the alias\nthe convention forbids. The generated prose also contains an em-dash, which\n`make docs-check` fails on.\n\nNeither file had reached this tree yet, so this shuts the door first.\nDeleting them by hand does not hold either, because the next `next dev` writes\nthem again. This is a template defect, not a per-repo one.\n\n`agentRules` is a top-level NextConfig option in the pinned next 16.3.x, not an\nexperimental one (config-shared.d.ts, default true; the writer is\nserver/lib/generate-agent-files.js, called behind an isDev check, which is why\nthe CI production build never surfaced it). Setting it false in\nui/next.config.mjs turns the generation off at the source.\n\nThe guard lives in\n`tests/unit/test_ui_surface.py`\nand has two halves. Asserting the flag catches its removal; asserting both\nfiles are ABSENT catches a framework bump that renames or drops the option,\nwhich the flag assertion alone would sail straight through.\n\nSame change as hex-service-template PR 15, which carries the proof: a repo\nrendered, installed and started on the same next version with agent detection\non, before and after. Before, both files and the generation line in the log;\nafter, neither. Verified here by this repo''s own offline gate.","tree":{"sha":"4a980687333fd2feb682e6d62777e44454bae63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/4a980687333fd2feb682e6d62777e44454bae63f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDAwODJjZWY3ZTJhNGYzOTk4YWI1ZWVjM2JjOTYyMWU3MWU2OWIzMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c","sha":"8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c"}],"sha":"0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/0082cef7e2a4f3998ab5eec3bc9621e71e69b329"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:07:36Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:11:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Kill the hydration check''s server by process group, not by its wrapper\n\nThe ui-check step reached \"OK ... the page hydrates\" and then hung until the\n600s Cloud Build deadline, twice in each of these repositories, while every\nsibling finished in 68 to 266 seconds.\n\nassert-hydratable starts the built server with npx, which is a wrapper around\nthe real next process. Signalling only the wrapper leaves the grandchild alive\nholding the script''s stdio pipes, so node never exits: the assertion passes\nand the build times out anyway, which reads as a broken repository rather than\na finished check. Spawning into its own process group and signalling the group\n(escalating to SIGKILL, then dropping the pipes) is what 47 of the 49 sibling\nrepositories already do; the two rendered on 2026-09-01 are the only ones that\ndid not, because the fix was made in the repositories and never back-ported to\nhex-service-template.\n\nThe nanoid package-lock bump rides along because it is the other half of the\nsame red step: npm audit fails ui-check on a high advisory, so neither fix\nalone turns this build green.\n\nThe defect does not reproduce on macOS, where the wrapper does not survive as\na separate process. The proof is the hosted build.","tree":{"sha":"6ee785aa4bc066c2bac453684f7901e6ae296b79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/6ee785aa4bc066c2bac453684f7901e6ae296b79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDgyNDQ3OTRhODcwMGYzYTlkOTI2MDVhOGVmM2YxMWVjNzE3NDFiOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0","sha":"2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0"}],"sha":"8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/8244794a8700f3a9d92605a8ef3f11ec71741b8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T23:08:34Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T05:11:41Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Take the nanoid patch that clears the high advisory in ui-check\n\n`npm audit --audit-level=high --prefix ui` fails on GHSA-2v37-7h3g-55p8: nanoid\nbelow 3.3.18 can loop indefinitely in a custom generator when size is zero. It\narrives here transitively through next, and `make ui-check` runs that audit as\nits last command, so the target has been red since the advisory published.\n\nNothing caught it, because this repository''s hosted contract did not run\n`ui-check` -- the repository was outside `ci/gcp/repository-policy.json` and had\nno Cloud Build trigger at all. The first hosted run after registering it failed\nhere, in the offline-gate step, before `make gate` was even reached.\n\nForty-seven sibling repositories already carry nanoid 3.3.18. This is\n`npm audit fix --package-lock-only`, so only the lockfile moves: nanoid 3.3.17 ->\n3.3.18, `package.json` untouched, next left at its pinned 16.3.0, and the audit\nreports zero vulnerabilities afterwards. `make ui-check` passes end to end --\nlint, node tests, production build, hydration assertion and the audit.","tree":{"sha":"264b66cf38d6b12bd9fe43892b56030cd04e312d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/264b66cf38d6b12bd9fe43892b56030cd04e312d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDJlYjlkMjI1NTk1NjgwMDQzZmU5MjU4NzIyY2E3YzlkMDAxMTAyYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763","sha":"2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763"}],"sha":"2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2eb9d225595680043fe9258722ca7c9d001102c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T22:40:54Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T23:03:16Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Declare google-cloud-bigquery, which the portfolio feed imports\n\n`adapters/gcp/portfolio_feed.py` lazy-imports `google.cloud.bigquery` to read the\nobligor-metrics and servicing dataset, and the package was declared in no lockfile\nand in no extra. Every profile still CONSTRUCTED cleanly, because the import sits\ninside `_query` deliberately, so nothing offline could see it: the first query\nagainst a deployed service would have raised ImportError, with the adapter''s own\nconfiguration refusal already passed.\n\nTwenty-four sibling repositories that import the same module declare it; this one\ndid not. The gap survived because this repository sits outside\n`ci/gcp/repository-policy.json`, so the hosted `lint-gcp` job -- the only check in\nthe fleet that type-checks against the RUNTIME lock and can therefore see the cloud\nadapters at all -- has never run against it. `mypy` under the dev lock resolves\n`google.*` to Any and reports nothing; against the runtime lock it reports\n`Module \"google.cloud\" has no attribute \"bigquery\"`, which is exactly how this\nwas found.\n\nThe relock is purely additive: `google-cloud-bigquery==3.44.0` and its transitive\ndependencies. No existing pin moved, and `requirements-dev.lock` is unchanged, so\nthe offline gate installs no more than it did before.\n\nVerified with both interpreters matched to the hosted runner''s python3.14:\n`make gate` (644 passed), `make ui-check`, `terraform test` (14 passed), the IAP\nruntime-lock matrix (22 passed, no skips), and `lint-gcp` clean over 67 files.","tree":{"sha":"0e96b7515bf6b10b7aa1be1a05ed7feda40cd543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/0e96b7515bf6b10b7aa1be1a05ed7feda40cd543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDJhNGE5Mzc0OWRiNWNiYzk5NDc2M2JjNTNhYTc5ZjRkODdjYjA3NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76","sha":"2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76"}],"sha":"2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2a4a93749db5cbc994763bc53aa79f4d87cb0763"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:41:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:41:49Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"message":"Credit portfolio early warning and covenant monitoring\n\nPost-origination monitoring of the lending book, scaffolded from\nhex-service-template and carrying its own vertical.\n\nThe consequential half is pure stdlib and replayable: covenant status against\nthe terms credit-memo-drafting extracts at origination, early-warning signals\nscored per family with caps so no single family can classify an obligor alone,\nand a watchlist grade proposal on the supervisory ladder. The model narrates\nand drafts the review memo; it owns no outcome. Nothing re-grades an obligor:\nevery proposal routes to a human, and moving an exposure out of performing or\nback into it takes two approvals.\n\nCovenant vocabulary is consumed verbatim from the origination service and\npinned by a test, because a divergent enum is how two services quietly stop\ndescribing the same covenant.\n\nOffline gate, demo self-test, docs check, portability and tf-check all green.\nThe remaining gaps are recorded on the catalog row, model risk first: the\nengine is a model whatever it is written in, and its weights and band edges\nare reference defaults rather than a calibrated scorecard.","tree":{"sha":"a2fe9690eb6250becb83f46cff7d481eca82374d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/trees/a2fe9690eb6250becb83f46cff7d481eca82374d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/git/commits/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commit/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkDNoAKDJiNWVhMTg5MzQ5NWRiYTkwZTExNzlhZDVmNzc4MTg4Y2M3Y2FlNzY","parents":[],"sha":"2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits/2b5ea1893495dba90e1179ad5f778188cc7cae76"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/credit-portfolio-early-warning/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=9e41f35fd0cdee032a3328b465a1cc182921b9ab&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A07.165Z"}');
