lls beside google-adk. No API change.\n\nRelocked so that only the kit pin moves; the repository''s own gate is green.","tree":{"sha":"d1a94350b6a5979af85dcf1cb36e6453ad43eba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/trees/d1a94350b6a5979af85dcf1cb36e6453ad43eba8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/commits/6e002f60734fb0a9e1183e661a788077e59a2a31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commit/6e002f60734fb0a9e1183e661a788077e59a2a31","node_id":"C_kwDOUKLkONoAKDZlMDAyZjYwNzM0ZmIwYTllMTE4M2U2NjFhNzg4MDc3ZTU5YTJhMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commit/f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307","sha":"f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commits/f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307"}],"sha":"6e002f60734fb0a9e1183e661a788077e59a2a31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commits/6e002f60734fb0a9e1183e661a788077e59a2a31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commits/f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:02:21Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:17:47Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Default model_armor_full_capabilities to false; examples state it\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The regional Model Armor capabilities (the malicious-URI\nfilter and multi-language detection) defaulted on, which also meant a plan in\nasia-southeast1, the fleet''s default region, failed with\nCAPABILITY_NOT_SUPPORTED until a deployment knew to turn them off.\n\nThe variable now defaults to false with one canonical description, the\nexample states the line uncommented, and the comments that said \"default\ntrue\" say otherwise. A Terraform test that relied on the old default now\nstates true, and a new run pins the new default: neither capability arrives\nunless stated.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green.","tree":{"sha":"8c53b4c65ce61391c1451d30a1a968080b43a19f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/trees/8c53b4c65ce61391c1451d30a1a968080b43a19f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/commits/f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishawasthi","id":72717,"login":"ashishawasthi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commit/f7114759d82423e9d3658eb733e31889bfc64307","node_id":"C_kw