"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/commits/a7a4d2640a87ab51877371a550cd02ce36f96606/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:03:10Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish Awasthi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T22:09:29Z","email":"ashish.awasthi@gmail.com","name":"Ashish"},"message":"Replace the provenance banner with answer pills; sample per call site\n\nThe console now shows two small pills at the top right: the model that answered\n(X-Answered-By, falling back to generator_model from /healthz) and Search when the\nanswer used an online search tool. The API installs install_answer_provenance, the\nNext.js proxy forwards both headers, and the old banner component and CSS are gone.\n\nThe managed generation adapter notes the model it called and the local stub notes its\nown name. GenerationRequest.temperature is optional: drafting the narrative sends none,\nclassification and normalisation stay pinned at 0.0. The managed call previously sent\n0.2 for all three. hex-service-kit bumped to v0.0.10; use_hard_reasoning removed from\nthe generator_model resolver.","tree":{"sha":"5d8050b934e81ce1e78ca2fee74d28b1cbd8cd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/trees/5d8050b934e81ce1e78ca2fee74d28b1cbd8cd78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/portable-genai/exam-rfi-orchestrator/git/commits/a7a4d2640a87ab51877371a550cd02ce36f96606","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72717?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishawasthi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.g