y/commit/ec59ec5ad80947334f9f2dbac01531416faa97f2","sha":"ec59ec5ad80947334f9f2dbac01531416faa97f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-revision-history/commits/ec59ec5ad80947334f9f2dbac01531416faa97f2"}],"sha":"1a911e9a1dacad584ef5d9c805450ab56cba3fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-revision-history/commits/1a911e9a1dacad584ef5d9c805450ab56cba3fa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-revision-history/commits/ec59ec5ad80947334f9f2dbac01531416faa97f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T13:58:00Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T13:58:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): serve the markdown template type as plain text, not HTML (#17)\n\nFixes GHSA-4hvq-2x8x-49w2, stored cross-site scripting.\n\nThe markdown views print node content unescaped by design -- bigText emits\nrich text verbatim for MarkdownNormalizer to convert -- but Jahia''s Render\nservlet fell back to text/html for the markdown template type, which is\nabsent from its content-type map. Every .markdown URL was therefore an\nunescaped HTML document, reachable with no session, on every page in the\ninstallation rather than only revisioned ones.\n\nReproduced on 8.2.3.2 before fixing: anonymous GET answered 200 with\nContent-Type: text/html and a payload placed in a page title came back\nbyte-for-byte intact.\n\nMarkdownContentTypeFilter declares text/plain plus nosniff for the whole\ntemplate type, which fixes the surface rather than the four print sites.\nEscaping was rejected because it would archive rich text as its own source\nand corrupt the record, and because it fixes four sites and not the class.\n\nThe body is deliberately unchanged: the payload must survive into the\nsnapshot as text, and the display paths were already escaped.","tree":{"sha":"155b1b4e63ca8ff90fd4228a565bad31baf96a54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-revision-history/git/trees/155b1b4e63ca8ff90fd4228a565bad31baf96a54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/content-revision-history/git/commits/ec59ec5ad80947334f9f2dbac01531416faa97f2","verification":{"payload":"tree 155b1b4e63ca8ff90fd4228a565bad31baf96a54\nparent fe6312796dd8fef69e26f7992c632f6709b21bee\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1788443880 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788443880 +0200\n\nfix(security): serve the markdown template type as plain text, not HTML (#17)\n\nFixes GHSA-4hvq-2x8x-49w2, stored cross-site scripting.\n\nThe markdown views print node content unescaped by design -- bigText emits\nrich text verbatim for MarkdownNormalizer to convert -- but Jahia''s Render\nservlet fell back to text/html for the markdown template type, which is\nabsent from its content-type map. Every .markdown URL was therefore an\nunescaped HTML document, reachable with no session, on every page in the\ninstallation rather than only revisioned ones.\n\nReproduced on 8.2.3.2 before fixing: anonymous GET answered 200 with\nContent-Type: text/html and a payload placed in a page title came back\nbyte-for-byte intact.\n\nMarkdownContentTypeFilter declares text/plain plus nosniff for the whole\ntemplate type, which fixes the surface rather than the four print sites.\nEscaping was rejected because it would archive rich text as its own source\nand corrupt the record, and because it fixes four sites and not the class.\n\nThe body is deliberately unchanged: the payload must survive into the\nsnapshot as text, and the display paths were already escaped.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmXzoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHqoQAHEY5hjHEJxx4QqYDTDSWezE\nchs5tbXgMkIaNoF5tvOz8oOjGu4agbKfYXk8MBlgaejzPAMzrerFdPP5mjTtSSGe\niybFGtjx8qsFNNNRu6kZpjY6N05fPKDLj0KiDXPqknGokpDw6inTQj/LRI5Z4aLj\nR13czdCfRyrevlna9wp9jHTcBsLQNZa2e/Bs27h20YkvOJC6iN72qMHNSZHHTeHH\nfNEiQzrcVWJOSP/v3v3/WSERloEFV/enihSQWQ4aXbk7SVEqW2MGKAdZ16ZDFg3e\nQM6uiDDHnfCfLu3w2ZbNC6c9uEcKt2FuUcTcAe6A5lT8sRzNVkNH4AXEo2Bsyy5S\nFpaCxPQPn+AFxrUEYLmBeLMdtxF8zcwrEQmhOFEyiHUMSHC4o5nVnksDOvciFKRU\nZX2fJZCf4bUbw0DwKb5rgB8tYq6uEm7DCoYTZwYLIj+8kdxKsaLuljksQI1gPhGJ\nuk2m335jZUCtC0lB9wTU5RCOhrWCIihyrVfe/BCbLQtvfdqi5fj7C0mSuaTQndyp\npt7MNYbsGHHSuJcXJMRbS98IXcN5O4dXvBx6DPXP0rX6oU+fVjjZ/4NBespAgDSD\nMUvdvJ/J4SZ0JeLsoQobxage5g+Cs7iAwmAUeSj+rfIvudMyKxuh9Nqr+3RCh7+P\nBVS0HBAW7QJN4uUdpSZ5\n=W2eN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T13:58:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.