ithub.com/users/it2-clarissa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/it2-clarissa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Brianlian-EJI/asset-management-fe/commits/505488f7129f9df3a8bfa80b624dad44dba94d8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:36:11Z","email":"it2@eji.co.id","name":"EJI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:38:14Z","email":"it2@eji.co.id","name":"EJI"},"message":"feat: OData grid pages (mono-libs pattern)\n\nRewrote the 3 pages to the mono-libs data-grid pattern (replacing the wrong\nmonoRestFetch stubs):\n- monoCreateFetcher({configBaseUrl:''myOdata'', url:''/Assets''|''/Assignments''|''/Opnames''})\n  .response({options:{key:''id'', select, paginate, pageSize, sort}}) -> DataSource\n- monoDataGrid(dataSource, {searchExpr}) driving <mono-table-search|page-size|sort|info|\n  paging> bound via :data-grid.prop; rows mirrored from controller.items.\n- REST actions (register/assign/submit/review) via monoFetch(url,{configBaseUrl:''myRest'',\n  method:''POST'', body: JSON.stringify(...)}).\n- src/datas/tables/{registration,assignment,opname}.ts: cols + $select + searchExpr\n  (camelCase fields, key ''id'' — base OData EnableLowerCamelCase).\n\nNot yet runtime-verified (pending pnpm install / mono prepare). Uses string OData urls +\nuntyped rows, so odata2ts codegen isn''t required to compile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8947221025deb787150b707bf9dfc77f72c55bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Brianlian-EJI/asset-management-fe/git/trees/8947221025deb787150b707bf9dfc77f72c55bee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Brianlian-EJI/asset-management-fe/git/commits/505488f7129f9df3a8bfa80b624dad44dba94d8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247080151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c