nt"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:28:50.532Z","repositoryId":1353368522,"sha":"97cff546870116c18ab9f64dcb7e6b3d920b650d"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:28:50.532Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/1d94b8595edb42e65fd09f6d8e22976edb0caa61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:30:21Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T12:30:21Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"message":"feat: deploy Ronnie OS to Vercel with production voice endpoint\n\nAdd Vercel deployment configuration so Ronnie OS runs as a real hosted\nweb app instead of a localhost-only dev setup:\n\n- vercel.json: SPA rewrite (/(.*) -> /index.html) so direct navigation\n  and refreshes on /today, /log, /voice work correctly. Vercel always\n  resolves real files, including everything under /api, before\n  applying rewrites, so this does not shadow the API routes.\n- api/health.js: Vercel Function equivalent of the local /health route.\n- api/voice/session.js: Vercel Function equivalent of the local\n  /api/voice/session route. Reuses the existing\n  server/voice/createSession.mjs session logic unchanged, so local and\n  production behavior stay identical. OPENAI_API_KEY is read only from\n  process.env at request time inside this server-side function and is\n  never bundled into client code.\n- README.md: documents the production architecture, how to connect\n  the GitHub repo to Vercel, the required OPENAI_API_KEY/VOICE_MODEL/\n  VOICE_ALLOWED_ORIGIN environment variables (set in Vercel, never\n  committed), and how to verify a deployment.\n- .gitignore: ignore the Vercel CLI''s local .vercel/ project-link\n  cache.\n\nThe local server/index.mjs Node HTTP server is unchanged and remains\nfor local development only; production traffic is served entirely by\nVercel''s static hosting and these two Functions. No activity/database\narchitecture, voice client behavior, or UI was modified.","tree":{"sha":"84cceed691bffd8abe017e9ebd9d839a7c83f4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/trees/84cceed691bffd8abe017e9ebd9d839a7c83f4b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/commits/1d94b8595edb42e65fd09f6d8e22976edb0caa61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commit/1d94b8595edb42e65fd09f6d8e22976edb0caa61","node_id":"C_kwDOUKrDytoAKDFkOTRiODU5NWVkYjQyZTY1ZmQwOWY2ZDhlMjI5NzZlZGIwY2FhNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commit/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e","sha":"bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e"}],"sha":"1d94b8595edb42e65fd09f6d8e22976edb0caa61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/1d94b8595edb42e65fd09f6d8e22976edb0caa61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:09:39Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:09:39Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"message":"fix: make local voice server startup clone-safe\n\nSwitch the server npm script from --env-file to --env-file-if-exists\nso the backend starts on a fresh clone without requiring .env.local\nto already exist. Without a configured OPENAI_API_KEY, the server\nstill starts and serves /health; /api/voice/session responds with a\nsafe 503 instead of failing to boot. Update README to describe the\ncorrect local dev flow (npm run server + npm run dev) and clarify\nthat .env.local is only needed for real voice sessions.","tree":{"sha":"69e982eed32096ad25a0170db2404cf02896fd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/trees/69e982eed32096ad25a0170db2404cf02896fd16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/commits/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commit/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e","node_id":"C_kwDOUKrDytoAKGJjZjI1MDk4NGYxNjc1NWJhMDk3M2NmMDcyNDE1MThmMDQzYmMxM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commit/73f1b2c363fe99df4eaf034246b8bbd6693c17fa","sha":"73f1b2c363fe99df4eaf034246b8bbd6693c17fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/73f1b2c363fe99df4eaf034246b8bbd6693c17fa"}],"sha":"bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/bcf250984f16755ba0973cf07241518f043bc13e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiro-agent","id":244629292,"login":"kiro-agent","node_id":"U_kgDODpS_LA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiro-agent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/commits/73f1b2c363fe99df4eaf034246b8bbd6693c17fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:41:18Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:41:18Z","email":"244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Kiro Agent"},"message":"feat: add realtime voice assistant shell\n\nAdd a tool-free OpenAI Realtime WebRTC voice conversation shell:\n\n- Native Node backend (server/index.mjs, server/voice/createSession.mjs)\n  proxies browser SDP offers to OpenAI''s /v1/realtime/calls using a\n  server-only OPENAI_API_KEY (never exposed to the client), with request\n  validation, size limits, and a bounded concurrent-session guard.\n- Frontend WebRTC client (src/voice/voiceClient.ts) and session hook\n  (src/voice/useVoiceSession.ts) implementing an explicit state machine\n  (idle/requesting-permission/connecting/connected/listening/speaking/\n  muted/ending/error), mic permission, peer connection lifecycle with\n  stale-session cancellation, data-channel transcript/event handling,\n  mute/unmute, end, and retry, with guaranteed microphone track cleanup.\n- Voice UI (VoiceButton, VoiceSession, VoiceStatus, VoiceTranscript,\n  VoicePage) wired into App.tsx navigation alongside Today and Log.\n- Vite dev proxy for /api and an npm run server script; no new\n  dependencies added.\n\nThis is intentionally scoped to Phase 1: no tools, no activity/database\ncoupling, no persistence of voice conversations, and no additional\nintelligence features.","tree":{"sha":"162c80a92d2e3f7630e4ca457355da20b703f52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/trees/162c80a92d2e3f7630e4ca457355da20b703f52a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Siphiwe-Khumalo/Ronnie-OS/git/commits/73f1b2c363fe99df4eaf034246b8bbd6693c17fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/244629292?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.c