:57:28Z","email":"jejakawan@ja-dev.lan","name":"jejakawan"},"message":"feat(theme-registry): ADR-023 phase 1 — first-party theme packs + license quotas\n\n- Add 4 thin theme-pack manifests in backend/theme-packs/ (theme-janari, theme-layung, theme-sarangenge, theme-sareupna)\n- ExtensionFamilyCatalog: THEME family constant, 4 slug mappings, firstPartyThemePackSlugs(), premiumThemePackSlugs(), resolve type=theme\n- ExtensionPaths: themePacksRoot(), discoverThemePackDirectories()\n- ExtensionBootstrapService: discover theme-packs; type=theme valid; store theme_flags + theme_slug in manifest column\n- LicenseService: getThemeQuota() per tier (community=0, pro=1, enterprise=null), remainingPremiumSlots(), isThemeServeEntitled(); deprecate premium_themes boolean; wire ThemeDowngradeRemediator on syncHeartbeat + deactivateLicense\n- ThemeDowngradeRemediator: new service — revert served theme to janari + clear snapshot on entitlement violation (ADR-023 §2.7)\n- ThemeService: harden activateTheme() with 4 hard-block gates (layout active, pack enabled, parent pack, license quota); block deactivateTheme(janari); add isThemePackEnabled(), getEntitledThemeSlugs()\n- ThemePackageInstallService: ZIP guards — first-party slug collision, community block, Pro slot count (ADR-023 §2.5)\n- Seed guards: LayungThemeDemoSeeder, SarangengeThemeDemoSeeder, SareupnaThemeDemoSeeder skip if max_premium_active=0; ThemeSeedCommand --all respects quota\n- InstallProfileApplicator: enable theme-janari pack in sys_extensions during cms/cms_site baseline (ADR-023 §2.2, §2.3)\n- Tests: ThemePackRegistryTest — 24 test cases covering quota, entitlement, discovery, manifest columns\n- Docs: module-contract.md type field updated; install-profiles.md theme baseline note; work brief status=done","tree":{"sha":"d90fed0b4d26d8354275d2ab9441d306b6742a2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/git/trees/d90fed0b4d26d8354275d2ab9441d306b6742a2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/g