with post details, likes, comments, and external link\n  - Add fail-safe unmount for public sites and notice card for builder canvas\n  - Register dynamic block in engineThemeBlockLoaders and Page Builder BlockRenderer\n\n- Theme Customizer Hardening:\n  - Normalize string vs object options array handling in SettingControl.vue\n  - Add effectiveSelectValue computed property with automatic fallback to schema defaults\n  - Standardize schema.settings.json and theme.json options across Sarangenge, Janari, and Layung\n\n- Quality, Parity, and Documentation:\n  - Full i18n symmetry (9,002 keys across id, en, su) with safe @ character escaping\n  - Pass 4/4 backend tests and 282/282 frontend unit tests (100%)\n  - Add ADR-002, ADR-003, and update tasks.md and README.md","tree":{"sha":"c59ee8626444e0974732d94f9d37a8639652a256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/git/trees/c59ee8626444e0974732d94f9d37a8639652a256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/git/commits/1ef3a74c59a4754b99920c9440e35f13eadef041","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/k2netid/portal/commit/1ef3a74c59a4754b99920c9440e35f13eadef041","node_id":"C_kwDOUKro4toAKDFlZjNhNzRjNTlhNDc1NGI5OTkyMGM5NDQwZTM1ZjEzZWFkZWYwNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/k2netid/portal/commit/deddebc0765d28a3112ab07b17b099cdd4de2d17","sha":"deddebc0765d28a3112ab07b17b099cdd4de2d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/commits/deddebc0765d28a3112ab07b17b099cdd4de2d17"}],"sha":"1ef3a74c59a4754b99920c9440e35f13eadef041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/commits/1ef3a74c59a4754b99920c9440e35f13eadef041"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/k2netid/portal/commits/deddebc0765d28a3112ab07b17b099cdd4de2d17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:10:01Z","email":"jejakawan@smkn6bandung.sch.id","name":"jejakawan"},"comm