,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia/Nutritri/commit/9c17df8d0cd37fcc6b54f5bd4f11ba06c4182e35","node_id":"C_kwDOUK2QctoAKDljMTdkZjhkMGNkMzdmY2M2YjU0ZjViZDRmMTFiYTA2YzQxODJlMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia/Nutritri/commit/1f08f8d9bf11ac66411cfd2dc0b3bc0483f34730","sha":"1f08f8d9bf11ac66411cfd2dc0b3bc0483f34730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/1f08f8d9bf11ac66411cfd2dc0b3bc0483f34730"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia/Nutritri/commit/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441","sha":"49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441"}],"sha":"9c17df8d0cd37fcc6b54f5bd4f11ba06c4182e35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/9c17df8d0cd37fcc6b54f5bd4f11ba06c4182e35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:14:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T20:14:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix Alert.alert silently doing nothing on web\n\nreact-native-web''s Alert.alert is a no-op stub (confirmed by reading\nits source: `static alert() {}`) — it never shows anything and never\ncalls a button''s onPress. That broke every confirmation/error dialog\nin the app on web, most visibly \"Confirmar importação\" on the plan\nimport screen: the file loaded and parsed fine, but clicking confirm\ndid nothing because the whole action lived inside the destructive\nbutton''s onPress, which never fired.\n\nAdded src/platformAlert.ts (showAlert) as a drop-in replacement for\nthe two Alert.alert shapes used in this app: a plain info message and\na Cancelar/action confirm dialog. On native it delegates to the real\nAlert.alert; on web it falls back to window.alert/window.confirm.\nSwapped all 5 call sites (index.tsx, health/index.tsx,\nplan/[weekday].tsx, export.tsx, plan/import.tsx) to use it.\n\nVerified against the actual web export, served under the real\n/Nutritri/ subpath: picked a test xlsx, clicked \"Confirmar\nimportação\", the browser confirm dialog fired and was accepted, and\nthe data landed — the day''s meal count on the home screen changed\nfrom the default 5 slots to the 1 imported slot, proving the import\nactually applied this time.","tree":{"sha":"cb70885c7c81e2e845a689e56565b4a9bd3de1a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/git/trees/cb70885c7c81e2e845a689e56565b4a9bd3de1a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/git/commits/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441","verification":{"payload":"tree cb70885c7c81e2e845a689e56565b4a9bd3de1a9\nparent 5737f7071bbcd5818164d04d6c83c01f51187f78\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788380092 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788380092 +0000\n\nFix Alert.alert silently doing nothing on web\n\nreact-native-web''s Alert.alert is a no-op stub (confirmed by reading\nits source: `static alert() {}`) — it never shows anything and never\ncalls a button''s onPress. That broke every confirmation/error dialog\nin the app on web, most visibly \"Confirmar importação\" on the plan\nimport screen: the file loaded and parsed fine, but clicking confirm\ndid nothing because the whole action lived inside the destructive\nbutton''s onPress, which never fired.\n\nAdded src/platformAlert.ts (showAlert) as a drop-in replacement for\nthe two Alert.alert shapes used in this app: a plain info message and\na Cancelar/action confirm dialog. On native it delegates to the real\nAlert.alert; on web it falls back to window.alert/window.confirm.\nSwapped all 5 call sites (index.tsx, health/index.tsx,\nplan/[weekday].tsx, export.tsx, plan/import.tsx) to use it.\n\nVerified against the actual web export, served under the real\n/Nutritri/ subpath: picked a test xlsx, clicked \"Confirmar\nimportação\", the browser confirm dialog fired and was accepted, and\nthe data landed — the day''s meal count on the home screen changed\nfrom the default 5 slots to the 1 imported slot, proving the import\nactually applied this time.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJey9Ptr\nsWlYfCHHRqTeXO3CeZkFfNsDNgqB/5i71TFGPLMG+a9Z41AqG/bBjh/6v6CKkDwrB9aLAms7idZh\nwgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T20:14:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia/Nutritri/commit/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441","node_id":"C_kwDOUK2QctoAKDQ5YWE1NDAwMzRiNmEyOWZjYzRjYzdjOTljYmMwMjFiMzNlY2Q0NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia/Nutritri/commit/5737f7071bbcd5818164d04d6c83c01f51187f78","sha":"5737f7071bbcd5818164d04d6c83c01f51187f78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/5737f7071bbcd5818164d04d6c83c01f51187f78"}],"sha":"49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/49aa540034b6a29fcc4cc7c99cbc021b33ecd441"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84099307?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/serrajordia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/serrajordia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/serrajordia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/serrajordia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/serrajordia","id":84099307,"login":"serrajordia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDk5MzA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/serrajordia/orgs","received_events_url":"https: