repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/commits/c9fc82e06e66dda18d4d525caa5af030ce2214bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T14:25:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T14:25:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Downgrade to Expo SDK 56 for Expo Go store compatibility\n\nSDK 57 is too new for the Expo Go client currently distributed on the\nApp/Play Store, so scanning the QR code failed with \"Project is\nincompatible with this version of Expo Go\". SDK 56 is the version\nactually shipped by the store build, so this pins expo and the\nexpo-* packages to their 56.x releases (react-native 0.85.3 to match).","tree":{"sha":"f7d4c24403fe68e56bf2d1daee99627849235583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/git/trees/f7d4c24403fe68e56bf2d1daee99627849235583"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serrajordia/Nutritri/git/commits/c9fc82e06e66dda18d4d525caa5af030ce2214bb","verification":{"payload":"tree f7d4c24403fe68e56bf2d1daee99627849235583\nparent 3b9bda4454f8f26967b50f001a6b8457cab88087\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788272718 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1788272718 +0000\n\nDowngrade to Expo SDK 56 for Expo Go store compatibility\n\nSDK 57 is too new for the Expo Go client currently distributed on the\nApp/Play Store, so scanning the QR code failed with \"Project is\nincompatible with this version of Expo Go\". SDK 56 is the version\nactually shipped by the store build, so this pins expo and the\nexpo-* packages to their 56.x releases (react-native 0.85.3 to match).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQ