e styling into shared POS UI\n\n* feat(cashier): align selling workspace with reference ui\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dxweb98 <dxweb98@gmail.com>\n\n* feat(cashier): complete UI assimilation and cashier experience foundation (#7)\n\n* feat(ui): assimilate legacy primitive styling into shared POS UI\n\n* feat(cashier): align selling workspace with reference ui\n\n* feat(cashier): restore assimilated cashier ui\n\n* feat(cashier): add local transaction demo\n\n* feat(cashier): add complete local demo transaction journey\n\n* chore(cashier): checkpoint demo flow and ui assimilation\n\n* feat(auth): add persistent demo authentication experience\n\n* feat(cashier): add member-aware customer selection flow\n\n* chore(ui): checkpoint canonical NewUi migration and consumer sync\n\n* fix(ui): resolve NewUi optional prop typecheck errors\n\n* fix(ui): expose canonical Dialog public API\n\n* fix(cashier): align variant dialog with canonical Dialog\n\n* fix(cashier): align branch dialog with canonical Dialog\n\n* chore(deps): add Digvation design system dependencies\n\n* feat(cashier): adopt Digvation design system in POS workspace\n\n* refactor(ui): adopt Digvation design system across POS apps\n\n* fix(cashier): refine workspace and branch composition\n\n* feat(auth): add cashier account and password change request flow\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: dxweb98 <dxweb98@gmail.com>\n\n* feat(backoffice): establish authenticated application shell\n\n* feat(backoffice): add access control management\n\n* feat(cashier): restore auth session and consume priced catalog\n\n* fix(cashier): reconcile priced catalog integration\n\n* fix(ui): align POS apps with design system configuration\n\n* feat(backoffice): add business and selling location management\n\nIntegrate the accepted business profile and selling-location management UI together with the approved Backoffice shell and consistency remediation.\n\n* feat(backoffice): complete catalog management and notifications (#9)\n\nCo-