"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/e1ecd808980baaa61d6247351fc87cd539b5a591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:57:09Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:57:09Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"message":"refactor(web): Account/Unit identifiers, kind select, pruned i18n\n\nAdmin, triage and shared auth use account/unit identifiers and the renamed\nAPI (/v1/accounts/…, /v1/admin/accounts, /v1/auth/accounts, activeAccount /\nactiveUnit, accountId / unitId, account_ids / unit_id). AccountForm gains the\nTipo de conta Select (company / ngo / school / university / other).\nlocalizeApiError maps the renamed API details (Unit/Account not found,\nAccount access denied, Select an account first, 410 Renamed). Fifty dead\nEmpresa/Estabelecimento dictionary entries removed; stale TenantRef/MarketRef\n/LocationRef aliases dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa423aa8b54d4efc85be7f8bc047f9505b1ca8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/aa423aa8b54d4efc85be7f8bc047f9505b1ca8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/e1ecd808980baaa61d6247351fc87cd539b5a591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU