//api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/3fdbd8b1d7f25c91829eda0371217ce46773faec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:54:33Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:54:33Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"message":"refactor(api,services): Company→Account, Establishment→Unit\n\nAPI: models Account(kind)/AccountUser/AccountUserMembership/Unit with\naccount_id/unit_id (deprecated Company*/Establishment aliases and\ncompany_id/establishment_id synonyms kept for one release — infra bootstrap\nimports them); AccountScopedMixin; GUC app.current_account_id;\nset_session_context(account_id=…, company_id= deprecated);\naccount_session/company_session; AuthContext.account_id/unit_id with alias\nproperties; edge JWT accepts account_id or company_id; SessionData writes\naccount_id/unit_id and reads the legacy keys (sessions live 7 days);\ndeps require_account_access/get_account_db; routes under\n/v1/accounts/{id}/…, /v1/admin/accounts, /v1/auth/accounts,\nactiveAccount/activeUnit, SwitchContextRequest{accountId, unitId} (location\naliases dropped); api/legacy.py answers 410 Gone on /v1/companies/*,\n/v1/admin/companies/* and /v1/auth/companies; StreamConfig emits\naccount_id/unit_id/unit_name; inbound webhooks and the ingest inject accept\nestablishment_id/company_id via AliasChoices; detections bridge and\nlatest-frame reader fall back to legacy stream fields. Fixes the webhook\ningest handler returning inside  (event was\nnever committed). scripts/validate_rls.py rewritten for the new schema;\nseeds/tests renamed (test_account_memberships, test_legacy_paths_gone).\n\nServices: stream-prep/edge-cv/prompt-eval use account_id/unit_id (MinIO key\n{account}/{unit}/{camera}, frames:ready and detections:positive emit the new\nnames) and accept company_id/establishment_id from legacy producers for one\nrelease; prompt-eval GUC app.current_account_id; _models_fallback mirrors 014.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f25aaf8d64c8ec185427118892b2719c91dddb3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/f25aaf8d64c8ec185427118892b2719c91dddb3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/3fdbd8b1d7f25c91829eda0371217ce46773faec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU0Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commit/3fdbd8b1d7f25c91829eda0371217ce46773faec","node_id":"C_kwDOUK8uyNoAKDNmZGJkOGIxZDdmMjVjOTE4MjllZGEwMzcxMjE3Y2U0Njc3M2ZhZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commit/961b8c3ae326218f26de9bbdfd7a63e5bcd7f16a","sha":"961b8c3ae3262