are\nrenamed from a schema-aware catalog scan through a shared _rename_map (names\ncan differ between Supabase and local volumes); RLS policies are dropped and\nrecreated on app.current_account_id; accounts.kind account_kind NOT NULL\nDEFAULT ''company''. Fully reversible (downgrade restores the old vocabulary and\napp.current_company_id policies). test_migration_014 runs the round trip on a\ndisposable database when ARGUS_MIGRATION_TEST_URL is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"847dec5fa266e7e1098e8534403d753554b4a9fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/847dec5fa266e7e1098e8534403d753554b4a9fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/961b8c3ae326218f26de9bbdfd7a63e5bcd7f16a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU0Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commit/961b8c3ae326218f26de9bbdfd7a63e5bcd7f16a","node_id":"C_kwDOUK8uyNoAKDk2MWI4YzNhZTMyNjIxOGYyNmRlOWJiZGZkN2E2M2U1YmNkN2YxNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commit/09558233f76008fa8b526bb36a3445e44dd5add8","sha":"09558233f76008fa8b526bb36a3445e44dd5add8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/09558233f76008fa8b526bb36a3445e44dd5add8"}],"sha":"961b8c3ae326218f26de9bbdfd7a63e5bcd7f16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/961b8c3ae326218f26de9bbdfd7a63e5bcd7f16a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU0Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/09558233f76008fa8b526bb36a3445e44dd5add8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:43:16Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:43:46Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"message":"feat(triage): camera grid per Unidade with case rail and drawer\n\nData layer: typed api.ts (listUnits, switchUnit, cameraOverview, listCases\nwith unit/camera filters, getCase, resolveCase, fetchLatestFrame with ETag),\npure feed.ts (caseFeedReducer FOLLOW/PINNED/idle/newCount, capacity 50,\nisStale, backoffDelay, openCountByCamera) and hooks: useTriageSocket\n(backoff reconnect, stops on 4001/4003), useCaseFeed (unit-filtered events,\nidle timer VITE_TRIAGE_IDLE_MS), useLatestFrame (2 s ETag poll, blob URL\nrevocation, pause when hidden, ok/stale/missing/error).\n\nUI: header Triagem · Conta · Unidade, UnitPicker (central screen when the\nsession has no unit), CameraGrid of CameraTile buttons (latest frame, Ao\nvivo/Sem sinal, open-case Badge, --alert ring on the camera of the newest\nopen case), sticky CaseRail (time, state Badge, camera name, ''N novos'' pill,\nWS status), Drawer with TriageDetail (Button loading per disposition, toast,\ninteraction resets idle). Companyless screen says Conta. ToastProvider in\nmain.tsx.\n\nvitest: root devDependency,\n> argus@0.0.0 test\n> npm run test -w ./apps/triage\n\n> argus-triage@0.0.0 test\n> vitest run\n\n RUN  v3.2.7 /home/ferre/Code/argus/apps/triage\n\n ✓ src/__tests__/feed.test.ts (12 tests) 4ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  12 passed (12)\n   Start at  19:43:16\n   Duration  201ms (transform 25ms, setup 0ms, collect 22ms, tests 4ms, environment 0ms, prepare 42ms) → apps/triage ,\nsrc/__tests__/feed.test.ts (12 tests). docs/realtime-page.md rewritten.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7fe3b9bd92ffcfd3a125063ffd7340a6143148e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/f7fe3b9bd92ffcfd3a125063ffd7340a6143148e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/09558233f76008fa8b526bb36a3445e44dd5add8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c