ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/commits/f37eeb4de5dce432ea4a84863aa2df4896698fc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:23:48Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T22:23:48Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"message":"feat(admin): react-router shell with SessionProvider\n\nReplace the single-page main.tsx with react-router v7: /sso/handoff, /login\nand / (RequireSession → AdminShell → Outlet). SessionProvider owns boot,\nsession, companies/establishments, the switching flag and sign-out; context\nswitches keep the returnTo/#token= handoff. The Sidenav uses DS Selects for\nConta/Unidade (disabled + spinner while switching) and NavLinks for Visão\ngeral / Unidades / Usuários / Contas. Login moves to Form + Button loading\nwith inline field errors; the dev-only default e-mail is gated on\nimport.meta.env.DEV. Typed api/client.ts and api/types.ts back every page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9be3a50c23a88429113698fb9ad3ad08267b9114","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/9be3a50c23a88429113698fb9ad3ad08267b9114"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/f37eeb4de5dce432ea4a84863aa2df4896698fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6V