ix(api): grant argus_app DML on public MVP tables\n\nMigration 008 granted the app role only on tables that existed then and set\ndefault privileges only for the Supabase ''argus'' schema, so on a fresh local\nvolume argus_app could not read establishments, prompt_sets, detections,\ntriage_cases, feedback, webhook_endpoints or context_events (seed_demo and the\nadmin API failed with permission denied). 013 grants per table guarded by\nto_regclass, and adds public default privileges only when no ''argus'' schema\nexists, so unrelated public tables on Supabase are never touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b97fe692eab946d0eb3b880aaad760abf055dbfd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/b97fe692eab946d0eb3b880aaad760abf055dbfd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/0e07b33f83bcd45177edf6e7e4222722e823bfc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU0Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi