Z","email":"guilhermesin2011@gmail.com","name":"Guilherme Ferreira"},"message":"feat(shared): typed ApiError, async hooks and Conta/Unidade i18n\n\napiFetch<T> now throws ApiError {status, detail, fieldErrors} (422 bodies are\nflattened per field; network failures get status 0). New @shared/hooks exposes\nuseAsync (stale-response safe, reload, setData) and useMutation (single\nin-flight request, never throws). Both apps alias @shared/hooks.\nlocalizeApiError accepts ApiError/Error/string and maps the real API details\n(Establishment/Company/Camera/Prompt not found, access denied, expired\nsession, duplicates, network). Dictionary gains the Conta/Unidade vocabulary\nand the loading/saving/retry state strings used by the new admin pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b52230bbddaec43e077e5774895f6dc3121a29db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/trees/b52230bbddaec43e077e5774895f6dc3121a29db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guilheeeeeeerme/argus/git/commits/7e616e74ce76684f56c8ec1cc1739b19139cf4c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2565469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guilheeeeeeerme","id":2565469,"login":"Guilheeeeeeerme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjU0Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guilheeeeeeerme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/