","sha":"16ca753cdfe4448666e7347df1988e2100209c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commits/16ca753cdfe4448666e7347df1988e2100209c64"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commit/5062d12fdc63e8163ce59a7d2bf364d226f26b0e","sha":"5062d12fdc63e8163ce59a7d2bf364d226f26b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commits/5062d12fdc63e8163ce59a7d2bf364d226f26b0e"}],"sha":"9e76f20e9ed552706bf9e996502afe8054a9ecde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commits/9e76f20e9ed552706bf9e996502afe8054a9ecde"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59595126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anish0714","id":59595126,"login":"anish0714","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTk1MTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commits/5062d12fdc63e8163ce59a7d2bf364d226f26b0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:08:48Z","email":"59595126+anish0714@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anish Dandekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:08:48Z","email":"59595126+anish0714@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anish Dandekar"},"message":"Add PDF Form Filler remote: fill real interactive AcroForm fields\n\nNew pdf-form-filler-remote (port 3006). Detects a PDF''s actual form\nfields via pdf-lib''s form API (text, checkbox, radio group, dropdown,\noption list), rendering each as its correct native control next to a\nread-only pdfjs-dist page preview, pre-filled with the field''s existing\nvalue.\n\nDeliberately does NOT try to overlay inputs on top of exact widget\npositions on the rendered page - mapping widgets to pages/coordinates\nvia raw PDF internals is fragile across real-world files. A clean\nlabeled form driven by pdf-lib''s field metadata is far more robust.\n\nSave & download writes values back into the actual AcroForm fields\n(verified by re-parsing the output and confirming every field''s value\nround-trips exactly, not just eyeballed). PDFs without real form fields\nget a clear message pointing to PDF Manipulation Tool''s Text tool\ninstead of silently failing or faking support.\n\nWires the new remote into the shell''s sidebar/Introduction and updates\nthe README. Does NOT touch .github/workflows/*.yml - this session''s git\ncredential lacks the `workflow` OAuth scope required to push changes to\nworkflow files; see PR description for the two small manual diffs still\nneeded (this is now the second remote pending that follow-up, alongside\ndev-utils-remote from PR #8).","tree":{"sha":"626283d2444f5822662132c08aece24c5efcbeeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/trees/626283d2444f5822662132c08aece24c5efcbeeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/commits/5062d12fdc63e8163ce59a7d2bf364d226f26b0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59595126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/following{/other_us