er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/commits/f4321e26d7fbdcdfa84b9a11ae160c4448b8d7fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:34:24Z","email":"59595126+anish0714@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anish Dandekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:34:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Consolidate remotes into pdf-conversion and pdf-manipulation tools (#2)\n\nReplaces the analytics-remote and notes-remote demo widgets with two\nreal PDF-focused micro-frontends:\n\n- pdf-conversion-remote (renamed from pdf-tools-remote): images -> PDF,\n  Word -> PDF, and merge PDFs, all client-side via pdf-lib/mammoth/jsPDF.\n- pdf-manipulation-remote: an in-browser PDF editor built on pdfjs-dist\n  (rendering) and pdf-lib (export) - add text, highlight or redact\n  content, delete pages, and save a new edited PDF.\n\nUpdates the shell''s remote registry and Module Federation config for the\nnew set, and updates ci.yml''s build matrix / deploy.yml''s asset paths to\nmatch.","tree":{"sha":"7327ab2bfb0d2ba9f1c5f98b5ace9e2768cd33c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/trees/7327ab2bfb0d2ba9f1c5f98b5ace9e2768cd33c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/commits/f4321e26d7fbdcdfa84b9a11ae160c4448b8d7fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 7327ab2bfb0d2ba9f1c5f98b5ace9e2768cd33c0\nparent d31bfed8469961b7ee9f261c9fc0b1c54047bef9\nauthor Anish Dandekar <59595126+anish0714@users.noreply.github.com> 1788287664 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788287664 -0400\n\nConsolidate remotes into pdf-conversion and pdf-manipulation tools (#2)\n\nReplaces the analytics-remote and notes-remote demo widgets with two\nreal PDF-focused micro-frontends:\n\n- pdf-conversion-remote (renamed from pdf-tools-remote): images -> PDF,\n  Word -> PDF, and merge PDFs, all client-side via pdf-lib/mammoth/jsPDF.\n- pdf-manipulation-remote: an in-browser PDF editor built on pdfjs-dist\n  (rendering) and pdf-lib (export) - add text, highlight or redact\n  content, delete pages, and save a new edited PDF.\n\nUpdates the shell''s remote registry and Module Federation config for the\nnew set, and updates ci.yml''s build matrix / deploy.yml''s asset paths to\nmatch.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlxqwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAw60QAHsbjRNtw8071IC7mtCBsmki\ntb1j8CYcHrnr+6H56evEamSNy2aTauS93S5/gWgduA9FGl4mz/BtjlfdmakYbKVs\nJkGbxgOMLS4jpyjxmJ5lPPXdcxPd4pT3CHygEMa+0mutv+XNxyxrMbOlP8Dmmhy+\nhEC5HeV72mqZV044XUf1dmgcpQe6sAT1ME+cuCYx3feyHsfaTq5RycSEn630lITF\nEFsmSuvbGTTaTmIMVl1IVOPteupmdwI9Mx2AwLPkv0YF9a3//TEMyOFXgOF7pM6A\n9ScckK/p5Jx77/hYEEW55eT+KPfGx7o/ARru3BPJGz53g45NxQthvxHLDFp6A7aS\ncx/Bs18FwF4ebN4DYNW+hgeJX3WFL0gNAvhHPsaaMibQyBPs6hjqR40o0PCtenCO\nnjTfMwUx08ssu2pn3D4EkfkotfcCyQGPQSoHjPbhScr8eteN5gWH4ZnK78I4sQFd\nDgHkL7H4HdNC8vzwoqgrV7+LDkn3Dh7QB7vN16+35+Uuj/xWr3GVJStYVBKDsGn8\nG/aLvVbk4p9CFM4xO6dNZrzyTNLEWVP/FtlWWHKqnY9CJ7e9aQzyo/p7SZqHgf+v\nJIBLakseyhgSDTht/wYl/m/rJvclfqu+gFBfJTdDMs+aJK1Er18BWCeruncRvokp\nhBK6xmZyvq/L0A5gYK2L\n=I+0J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T18:34:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"ht