@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anish Dandekar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:31:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Split CI/CD into per-package CI checks and a main-only deploy pipeline (#1)\n\n* Split CI/CD into per-package CI checks and a main-only deploy pipeline\n\nci.yml runs on PRs and non-main branches, lint+build-ing each package\n(shell, analytics-remote, notes-remote) in its own matrix job so failures\nare attributable per package. deploy.yml is now deploy-only, triggered by\npushes to main, keeping GitHub Pages publishing separate from PR validation.\n\n* Trigger ci.yml on pull_request only, not push, to avoid duplicate runs\n\nA branch with push:branches-ignore AND pull_request triggers both firing\nproduced two full sets of check runs per commit. Since the workflow is to\nalways open a PR immediately, pull_request alone is sufficient.","tree":{"sha":"4d094f3282f4e18bf4360f47c49bf962cf26ea70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/trees/4d094f3282f4e18bf4360f47c49bf962cf26ea70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/commits/d31bfed8469961b7ee9f261c9fc0b1c54047bef9","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d094f3282f4e18bf4360f47c49bf962cf26ea70\nparent 310dc8560ae96f3a6e92bdd27849f0f3c79e6c28\nauthor Anish Dandekar <59595126+anish0714@users.noreply.github.com> 1788287473 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788287473 -0400\n\nSplit CI/CD into per-package CI checks and a main-only deploy pipeline (#1)\n\n* Split CI/CD into per-package CI checks and a main-only deploy pipeline\n\nci.yml runs on PRs and non-main branches, lint+build-ing each package\n(shell, analytics-remote, notes-remote) in its own matrix job so failures\nare attributable per package. deploy.yml is now deploy-only, triggered by\npushes to main, keeping GitHub Pages publishing separate from PR validation.\n\n* Trigger ci.yml on pull_request only, not push, to avoid duplicate runs\n\nA branch with push:branches-ignore AND pull_request triggers both firing\nproduced two full sets of check runs per commit. Since the workflow is to\nalways open a PR immediately, pull_request alone is sufficient.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlxnyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPNAQAA4ZY6W9G4qIgmpmQnVZ+HmY\nCUka3E9qr1yjQnAh3qsNJbrnDnf5eEAsE4p51/2/T8/fvX69S9TcQtHvZOvop5Pk\ndmGwtSN82At0eYpSegpMZ4HbcYnXNvepohwSIzCq2Fi4fcFRXywpgPWYwPNIiV9I\naUgKJ/N8xuYzFZAU4LQzePqipW1l0LhU7IA8yGW0y6k1KOrB2tqjHGOkU9SCWbdl\nRuG3OHUQdpqZMXwGd+WaNeZnm4VKkMMpwwi79KD1EBXaqqOs5u8o4TzJmrEeFhyz\nh/dnnCMgxVol6Ed/eWK5fejgM+WpHLUzGzi06QegNO9H90/kQ4d5TH/rYVf3U/kp\nBypOjy74LoPZ6ys8YqCudG2UEK9BkV62t2x2JCG86gjV6/rvk7QR7BjqW+fXPSon\nrYzKfPpX1MXUneVaYoLus8k7R//kePWeDDI83K1Hm2ycF2KN7ml26atV9VQpnDPy\nyt7YL1WAv3M2gwDf39flctTrKyRYZ7dKxxJnyT9lKoo2C1CWh/VahMsANpBxKBEh\nhTTqI1lDarZyxnRId7/ewecV0lTg8/stB7yVny6oLZ7YVxMo+Nq2ayh0lMM6gUtx\nUJaTqfHpVs1dRGA+Ep0V/pO56tectTv98JEnSn+tnMe9vGRp2xfpdoSmbbd9MC6+\neAk9ATaa7mL9bZ5QTTlU\n=5zih\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T18:31:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https