b.com","name":"Anish Dandekar"},"message":"Initial commit: DevPulse micro-frontend showcase\n\nA shell app (host) composing two independently-built React remotes at\nruntime via Webpack 5 Module Federation:\n- analytics-remote: an analytics panel with local UI state\n- notes-remote: a notes list with its own independent localStorage\n\nnpm workspaces monorepo; each package builds and can be run standalone.\nCI/CD builds all three and assembles a single GitHub Pages deployment\n(shell at the root, remotes under /remotes/<name>/), with the shell''s\nproduction config pointing at the deployed remoteEntry.js URLs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6d62d66d1fbea37ccba9553b8097b3e6bf1845e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/trees/b6d62d66d1fbea37ccba9553b8097b3e6bf1845e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anish0714/devpulse-mfe/git/commits/310dc8560ae96f3a6e92bdd27849f0f3c79e6c28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59595126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anish0714","id":59595126,"login":"anish0714","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTk1MTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anish0714","us